<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.654" end="00:00:02.674" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.800" end="00:00:07.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOMMY.</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.500" end="00:00:07.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;M ALEX.</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.200" end="00:00:08.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;M NOAH.</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.900" end="00:00:09.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Milo.</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.700" end="00:00:10.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Cleo.</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.500" end="00:00:12.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Nina.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.200" end="00:00:13.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, squad. What&#39;s today&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.100" end="00:00:16.700" style="s2">mission?</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.100" end="00:00:18.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SELL 100 CHRISTMAS TOYS.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.700" end="00:00:19.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TOY.</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.500" end="00:00:21.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god, how did she manage to have so</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.900" end="00:00:24.400" style="s2">many five kids?</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.700" end="00:00:25.700" style="s2">If I hadn&#39;t been drugged that night,</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.400" end="00:00:27.200" style="s2">I never would have stumbled into the</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.700" end="00:00:29.800" style="s2">wrong room</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.200" end="00:00:32.800" style="s2">or woken up next to a stranger with five</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.800" end="00:00:32.800" style="s2">babies on the way.</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.200" end="00:00:38.400" style="s2">All right, babies, mission time.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.100" end="00:00:41.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $1 EACH. MERRY CHRISTMAS.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.400" end="00:00:41.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Merry Christmas.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.200" end="00:00:46.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, what the hell are you doing? Who</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.200" end="00:00:49.300" style="s2">gave you permission to bring your little</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.600" end="00:00:51.000" style="s2">mongrels here to peddle cheap trash?</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.300" end="00:00:53.100" style="s2">This is a luxury mall.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.000" end="00:00:53.900" style="s2">Get lost. I&#39;m running a legal business</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.100" end="00:00:55.400" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.900" end="00:00:57.000" style="s2">And how exactly are my kids bothering</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.400" end="00:00:59.100" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.000" end="00:01:00.500" style="s2">An unwed dropout like you dares to</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.100" end="00:01:02.100" style="s2">talk back?</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.500" end="00:01:04.900" style="s2">Grab your trash and your little mongrels</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.100" end="00:01:06.700" style="s2">and get the hell out.</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.900" end="00:01:08.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s bullying Mommy again.</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.700" end="00:01:10.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.200" end="00:01:11.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, if we just run out there, she&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.000" end="00:01:13.400" style="s2">just make more trouble for Mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.400" end="00:01:16.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do we do? Just stand here and</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.400" end="00:01:19.100" style="s2">let her pick on Mommy?</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.300" end="00:01:19.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got a plan.</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.100" end="00:01:24.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did those little mongrels go?</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.200" end="00:01:27.100" style="s2">Where are they hiding? My kids aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.800" end="00:01:27.100" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.500" end="00:01:32.400" style="s2">Still lying through your teeth? Then</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.100" end="00:01:33.000" style="s2">I&#39;ll drag those little mongers out</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.400" end="00:01:35.900" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.000" end="00:01:35.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LEAVE THEM ALONE.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.900" end="00:01:51.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT THE HELL? WHY ARE THERE FIVE DOGS?</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.900" end="00:01:55.900" style="s2">Who told you it was okay to shift in</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.400" end="00:01:55.900" style="s2">public?</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.486" end="00:02:04.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.592" end="00:02:07.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GRAB THOSE LITTLE BEASTS.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.592" end="00:02:14.192" style="s2">OH MY GOD, IS THAT DEREK ASHTON? He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.892" end="00:02:17.492" style="s2">even hotter in person. If I could marry</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.192" end="00:02:19.092" style="s2">him and have his babies, I&#39;d die happy.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.492" end="00:02:22.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What good is looking sharp if you can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.092" end="00:02:22.292" style="s2">even sire an heir?</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.492" end="00:02:26.692" style="s2">Look how cute you were as a pup. That</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.392" end="00:02:29.492" style="s2">moon birth mark on your chest, so vivid.</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.692" end="00:02:32.192" style="s2">Nothing like you now, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.492" end="00:02:34.992" style="s2">This Christmas, I want a wolf grandson</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.192" end="00:02:36.992" style="s2">who looks just like you did as a pup. If</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.992" end="00:02:39.692" style="s2">you can&#39;t bring one home, don&#39;t bother</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.992" end="00:02:39.692" style="s2">coming back.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.792" end="00:02:50.192" style="s2">My god.</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.192" end="00:02:50.192" style="s2">Isn&#39;t this my wolf grandson?</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.692" end="00:02:56.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re desperate for a grandson, but you</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.292" end="00:02:57.892" style="s2">can&#39;t just point at any pup and call him</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.992" end="00:02:59.892" style="s2">mine.</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.892" end="00:03:02.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open your eyes. This pup has the very</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.892" end="00:03:04.192" style="s2">same moon mark as you. Tell me,</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.692" end="00:03:06.592" style="s2">have you been with some woman behind my</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.192" end="00:03:06.592" style="s2">back?</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.892" end="00:03:10.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did my father send you? Get out. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.192" end="00:03:13.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So hot.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.692" end="00:03:13.292" style="s2">Kiss me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.192" end="00:03:19.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could that woman really have had my</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.692" end="00:03:21.392" style="s2">child?</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.492" end="00:03:25.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy warned us about bad people who</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.392" end="00:03:27.292" style="s2">grab pups. Are those guys pup nickers?</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.392" end="00:03:31.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t believe you secretly sired a</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.292" end="00:03:31.492" style="s2">full-grown pup and never told me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.092" end="00:03:38.492" style="s2">HEY, WHERE&#39;S MY GRANDSON? GO GET HIM</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.392" end="00:03:38.492" style="s2">BACK. HURRY.</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.012" end="00:03:45.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.092" end="00:03:49.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT DID I TELL YOU? No shifting in</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.792" end="00:03:49.492" style="s2">public. Shift back now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.992" end="00:03:57.392" style="s2">All right, let&#39;s head home.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.292" end="00:03:59.992" style="s2">Wait. 1 2 3 4</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.392" end="00:04:02.392" style="s2">5 Where&#39;s Theo?</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.992" end="00:04:02.392" style="s2">Theo?</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.592" end="00:04:07.094" style="s2">Where on did you go?</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.194" end="00:04:10.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, there was a weird uncle and a</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.994" end="00:04:13.194" style="s2">weird grandpa who kept saying I was</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.994" end="00:04:15.394" style="s2">their family&#39;s kid and wanted to take me</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.194" end="00:04:16.294" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.394" end="00:04:19.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god, they&#39;re probably</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.294" end="00:04:24.194" style="s2">putt-nackers. Squad, move now.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.894" end="00:04:24.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did a dog turn into a person?</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.994" end="00:04:31.094" style="s2">But that dog had turned into a little</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.894" end="00:04:34.894" style="s2">boy.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.094" end="00:04:36.594" style="s2">What? Could that really be my son?</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.894" end="00:04:38.794" style="s2">Quick, you have to find that child for</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.594" end="00:04:38.794" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.583" end="00:04:47.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.794" end="00:04:53.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, we&#39;re still hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.894" end="00:04:54.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God,</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.894" end="00:04:57.694" style="s2">these kids are going to eat me out of</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.894" end="00:04:57.694" style="s2">house and home.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.694" end="00:05:03.594" style="s2">A job interview. Talk about perfect</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.694" end="00:05:07.494" style="s2">timing. Squad, mommy&#39;s got an interview.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.594" end="00:05:07.494" style="s2">Finish your food and remember the rule.</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.194" end="00:05:11.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No shifting.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.294" end="00:05:31.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy works so hard for money. We got to</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.694" end="00:05:34.294" style="s2">find daddy fast so he can help.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.794" end="00:05:35.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But we&#39;ve checked so many. None of them</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.294" end="00:05:37.894" style="s2">were him.</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.394" end="00:05:41.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We haven&#39;t checked this guy yet.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.894" end="00:05:43.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s him, the weird uncle from today.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.594" end="00:05:45.894" style="s2">He and that weird grandpa said I was</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.894" end="00:05:48.994" style="s2">their family&#39;s kid and that I look</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.894" end="00:05:51.494" style="s2">exactly like him.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.994" end="00:05:55.094" style="s2">So could he be our daddy?</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.494" end="00:05:55.094" style="s2">His eyes look a lot like ours.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.094" end="00:06:01.994" style="s2">Got him. Derek Austin, CEO of the Austin</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.694" end="00:06:01.994" style="s2">Group.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.294" end="00:06:10.095" style="s2">Time to verify. Noah, Milo, with me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.895" end="00:06:10.095" style="s2">Theo, you&#39;ve got Nina. Split teams.</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.495" end="00:06:18.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; OPERATION FIND DADDY ENGAGED.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.895" end="00:06:24.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MS. WOOD, ALL candidates are here.</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.995" end="00:06:26.195" style="s2">I need to take a close look. See if</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.695" end="00:06:28.495" style="s2">there&#39;s any woman in here trying to get</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.195" end="00:06:30.295" style="s2">close to the CEO through this job.</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.495" end="00:06:32.595" style="s2">Ella?</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.295" end="00:06:33.795" style="s2">Blair? The one who spiked my drink years</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.595" end="00:06:36.279" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.795" end="00:06:38.299" style="s2">What&#39;s she doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.279" end="00:06:38.299" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.395" end="00:06:43.995" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.495" end="00:06:46.295" style="s2">Seriously? A dropout with a kid out of</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.995" end="00:06:49.795" style="s2">wedlock thinks she&#39;s qualified for CEO</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.295" end="00:06:51.495" style="s2">assistant? Get her out now.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.795" end="00:06:54.795" style="s2">We can&#39;t let trash like her tarnishing</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.495" end="00:06:54.795" style="s2">this company&#39;s reputation.</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.895" end="00:06:57.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got an interview invitation. On what</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.595" end="00:06:59.995" style="s2">grounds are you removing me?</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.995" end="00:07:03.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I&#39;m the HR director and the</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.995" end="00:07:03.195" style="s2">CEO&#39;s future wife.</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.789" end="00:07:06.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.395" end="00:07:09.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get your foot off. That&#39;s my portfolio.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.795" end="00:07:10.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Portfolio? Garbage made by a like</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.295" end="00:07:12.795" style="s2">you isn&#39;t even worth taking up space in</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.595" end="00:07:15.295" style="s2">a trash can.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.795" end="00:07:17.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give it back.</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.295" end="00:07:19.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, you treasure it that much? Then pick</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.195" end="00:07:19.895" style="s2">it up yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.440" end="00:07:25.460" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.885" end="00:07:37.905" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.640" end="00:07:51.660" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.495" end="00:07:58.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her face.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.895" end="00:08:00.995" style="s2">Why does it look so familiar?</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.395" end="00:08:00.995" style="s2">Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.595" end="00:08:05.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.795" end="00:08:07.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Derek, don&#39;t be deceived. She got</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.995" end="00:08:09.097" style="s2">pregnant out of wedlock and dropped out</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.697" end="00:08:10.997" style="s2">of school. Her character is</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.097" end="00:08:12.497" style="s2">questionable.</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.997" end="00:08:15.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And your assistant needs to be on call</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.497" end="00:08:17.097" style="s2">24/7. Can a single mom even handle that?</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.697" end="00:08:18.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Being a single mother doesn&#39;t disqualify</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.097" end="00:08:20.197" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.097" end="00:08:21.897" style="s2">I&#39;ve got kids to feed. I value this job</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.197" end="00:08:23.897" style="s2">more than anyone, and I get up at dawn</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.897" end="00:08:25.797" style="s2">to make formula. As long as the pay&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.897" end="00:08:26.897" style="s2">right, I can crank out proposals at</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.797" end="00:08:28.097" style="s2">dawn, too.</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.897" end="00:08:28.897" style="s2">Can you?</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.097" end="00:08:31.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You?</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.897" end="00:08:33.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If that pup is truly mine,</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.097" end="00:08:34.597" style="s2">has she endured all this alone?</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.297" end="00:08:36.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Security! Throw her out!</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.597" end="00:08:39.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough!</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.097" end="00:08:39.797" style="s2">This company answers to me, not you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.397" end="00:08:44.597" style="s2">You&#39;re hired as my personal assistant.</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.497" end="00:08:45.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me?</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.597" end="00:08:46.897" style="s2">Really?</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.097" end="00:08:51.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What, you don&#39;t want it?</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.897" end="00:08:51.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely! Thank you, Mr. Ashton.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.897" end="00:08:57.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elara, you you&#39;re already</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.197" end="00:08:57.597" style="s2">seducing Derek? This isn&#39;t over.</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.597" end="00:09:06.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So many people here, but not one is</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.297" end="00:09:09.397" style="s2">daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.797" end="00:09:10.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why haven&#39;t you found my grandson yet?</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.397" end="00:09:12.297" style="s2">What are you people even doing?</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.997" end="00:09:14.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Patriarch, don&#39;t worry. We&#39;ll go look</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.297" end="00:09:14.697" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.197" end="00:09:24.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ow! Your cane tripped me. MY LEG&#39;S</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.497" end="00:09:26.581" style="s2">BROKEN. YOU&#39;RE NOT GOING ANYWHERE TILL</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.297" end="00:09:26.897" style="s2">YOU PAY OFF 100 GRAND.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.581" end="00:09:29.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.897" end="00:09:29.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We saw the whole film.</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.097" end="00:09:36.597" style="s2">It was he who tripped you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.597" end="00:09:37.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You hear that? Even the kids saw it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.597" end="00:09:40.097" style="s2">Kids don&#39;t lie, right?</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.897" end="00:09:42.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Mr. If he WON&#39;T PAY, I</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.097" end="00:09:42.497" style="s2">WILL.</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.797" end="00:09:52.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little punk, you&#39;re messing with me</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.297" end="00:09:53.997" style="s2">with play money?</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.497" end="00:09:54.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait a minute. Didn&#39;t you say your leg</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.997" end="00:09:56.897" style="s2">was broken?</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.797" end="00:09:59.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mister, are you Superman? How&#39;d you heal</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.897" end="00:10:01.351" style="s2">so fast?</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.331" end="00:10:01.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.097" end="00:10:05.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kids,</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.197" end="00:10:09.297" style="s2">thank you for today.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.497" end="00:10:09.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No thanks needed, sir. Got to run.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.397" end="00:10:12.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.897" end="00:10:15.298" style="s2">That moon mark,</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.498" end="00:10:16.698" style="s2">you&#39;re my grandson.</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.298" end="00:10:19.298" style="s2">You&#39;re the pup from the other day,</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.698" end="00:10:19.298" style="s2">aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.798" end="00:10:25.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nina, run. You go find mommy. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.598" end="00:10:25.198" style="s2">distract him.</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.898" end="00:10:37.698" style="s2">Mommy, Theo and I ran into that pup</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.898" end="00:10:40.798" style="s2">napper again.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.698" end="00:10:40.798" style="s2">He&#39;s still after us.</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.198" end="00:10:46.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your desk is over there. Don&#39;t think</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.798" end="00:10:48.198" style="s2">just cuz Derek let you in</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.298" end="00:10:50.598" style="s2">you can climb your way up. Watch</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.198" end="00:10:51.698" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.598" end="00:10:53.998" style="s2">All right, I know my place better than</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.698" end="00:10:53.998" style="s2">you do.</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.498" end="00:11:00.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, Theo and I ran into that pup</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.598" end="00:11:02.998" style="s2">napper again. He&#39;s still after us.</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.898" end="00:11:04.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? I&#39;m coming right now. Stop right</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.998" end="00:11:06.298" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.598" end="00:11:07.698" style="s2">This is a workplace, not your personal</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.298" end="00:11:11.498" style="s2">playground.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.698" end="00:11:11.498" style="s2">My children are in danger. Move.</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.798" end="00:11:16.198" style="s2">If you dare walk out that door</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.898" end="00:11:19.998" style="s2">I&#39;ll fire you right now.</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.198" end="00:11:19.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Fire me. I quit.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.198" end="00:11:23.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.198" end="00:11:27.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you get in here? Where&#39;s Theo?</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.598" end="00:11:29.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That pup napper is still after him.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.198" end="00:11:31.698" style="s2">Mommy, find Theo now.</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.898" end="00:11:33.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pup nappers in the company</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.698" end="00:11:35.798" style="s2">lying at your age?</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.898" end="00:11:38.798" style="s2">Since your mother lacks discipline I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.798" end="00:11:38.798" style="s2">teach you a lesson for her.</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.698" end="00:11:46.598" style="s2">You dare hit me? Damn right I hit you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.498" end="00:11:48.698" style="s2">No one touches my kids but me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.598" end="00:11:51.598" style="s2">Like mother, like daughter, a whole</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.698" end="00:11:54.598" style="s2">family of ill-mannered trash. Security,</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.598" end="00:11:54.598" style="s2">throw them all out.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.398" end="00:12:02.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SWEETHEART, SLOW DOWN. GRANDPA CAN&#39;T</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.498" end="00:12:02.498" style="s2">KEEP UP. DEREK, STOP HIM.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.498" end="00:12:08.498" style="s2">IT&#39;S YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.798" end="00:12:10.098" style="s2">YOU&#39;RE THE PUP FROM THAT DAY.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.498" end="00:12:10.998" style="s2">You&#39;re my son.</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.098" end="00:12:13.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Theo, uncle.</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.998" end="00:12:14.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Derek, he has a sister too. You have two</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.399" end="00:12:14.899" style="s2">kids.</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.399" end="00:12:16.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two?</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.899" end="00:12:19.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hands off my child.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.699" end="00:12:23.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go save MOMMY AND NINA QUICK.</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.699" end="00:12:25.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SECURITY, THROW THEM ALL OUT.</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.299" end="00:12:26.999" style="s2">BLAIR, don&#39;t push it. If you&#39;ve got a</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.099" end="00:12:29.699" style="s2">problem, take it up with me. Leave my</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.999" end="00:12:29.699" style="s2">kids alone.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.199" end="00:12:34.999" style="s2">So what if I am? Let me tell you</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.099" end="00:12:38.999" style="s2">something. Derek and I are engaged.</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.999" end="00:12:38.999" style="s2">I set the rules here. Seize them.</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.199" end="00:12:43.699" style="s2">YOU LITTLE BASTARD, YOU BIT ME.</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.499" end="00:12:47.399" style="s2">LET HER GO.</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.999" end="00:12:50.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU YOU CAN&#39;T BREATHE.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.399" end="00:12:55.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STOP.</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.499" end="00:12:58.099" style="s2">Who gave you permission to hurt my</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.699" end="00:12:58.099" style="s2">child?</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.899" end="00:13:05.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetheart, eyes on mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.099" end="00:13:05.799" style="s2">Can you breathe?</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.099" end="00:13:10.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The woman from five years ago, it&#39;s her.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.899" end="00:13:12.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Derek, don&#39;t let this woman fool you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.899" end="00:13:13.299" style="s2">She knew you were searching for an heir,</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.299" end="00:13:14.699" style="s2">so she brought her brat here to</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.299" end="00:13:16.399" style="s2">manipulate you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.699" end="00:13:17.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I found the child. This is my</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.399" end="00:13:20.499" style="s2">granddaughter.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.499" end="00:13:21.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Then he truly is No, a woman of</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.499" end="00:13:22.599" style="s2">her station couldn&#39;t possibly bear your</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.999" end="00:13:24.299" style="s2">heir.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.599" end="00:13:25.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This kid looks exactly like Derek when</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.299" end="00:13:26.899" style="s2">he was little. Do you take me for a</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.699" end="00:13:29.299" style="s2">fool?</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.899" end="00:13:30.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blair, you&#39;re fired.</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.299" end="00:13:32.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m your fiance.</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.799" end="00:13:34.199" style="s2">You&#39;re firing me over a woman like this?</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.999" end="00:13:36.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our engagement was arranged by my</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.199" end="00:13:38.299" style="s2">mother. I never agreed to it. I only cut</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.699" end="00:13:39.799" style="s2">you slack because your family brought</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.299" end="00:13:40.899" style="s2">its business into the group. That</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.799" end="00:13:43.699" style="s2">doesn&#39;t mean you can do whatever you</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.899" end="00:13:45.299" style="s2">want here or hurt my kid.</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.699" end="00:13:47.899" style="s2">Finn.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.299" end="00:13:49.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Derek, please.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.899" end="00:13:50.499" style="s2">Mr. Ashton,</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.099" end="00:13:52.899" style="s2">I really didn&#39;t mean it. Please give me</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.499" end="00:13:55.299" style="s2">another chance.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.899" end="00:13:55.299" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.599" end="00:14:04.599" style="s2">Wait, that was you five years ago?</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.999" end="00:14:07.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.999" end="00:14:08.199" style="s2">You&#39;ve been doing this alone all these</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.099" end="00:14:10.899" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.199" end="00:14:10.899" style="s2">It couldn&#39;t have been easy.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.699" end="00:14:15.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really is our daddy. We&#39;re going to</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.499" end="00:14:15.601" style="s2">be a family.</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.099" end="00:14:17.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.601" end="00:14:19.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; is my kids father, but he&#39;s engaged to</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.601" end="00:14:21.901" style="s2">Blair. If she ends up being their</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.301" end="00:14:25.901" style="s2">stepmom, my kids are in for hell.</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.901" end="00:14:25.901" style="s2">No, we&#39;ve got to go now.</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.201" end="00:14:30.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, grandpa, mommy&#39;s running away.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.701" end="00:14:37.301" style="s2">Daddy, grandpa, mommy&#39;s running away.</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.401" end="00:14:41.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whose side are you two on anyway?</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.501" end="00:14:44.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My dear, don&#39;t go. You&#39;re my</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.901" end="00:14:46.801" style="s2">daughter-in-law. I&#39;m so sorry about</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.901" end="00:14:48.701" style="s2">today. We&#39;re finally back together as a</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.801" end="00:14:52.401" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.701" end="00:14:52.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, I&#39;m not your daughter-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.001" end="00:14:58.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve had it rough raising the kids</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.201" end="00:14:58.801" style="s2">alone all these years. Come home with</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.001" end="00:15:02.301" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.801" end="00:15:02.301" style="s2">I&#39;ll take responsibility for all of you.</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.701" end="00:15:06.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, I can&#39;t wait to have grandkids</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.401" end="00:15:07.601" style="s2">running around.</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.101" end="00:15:10.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But what if he marries Blair and takes</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.601" end="00:15:10.301" style="s2">my kids away?</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.101" end="00:15:15.801" style="s2">What are you crying for? Nobody eats</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.601" end="00:15:15.801" style="s2">TILL YOU GET THAT FLOOR CLEAN.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.601" end="00:15:22.501" style="s2">NO, I mean you&#39;ve got the wrong people.</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.601" end="00:15:24.701" style="s2">They&#39;re not your kids.</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.501" end="00:15:26.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible. These eyes and those noses</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.701" end="00:15:26.801" style="s2">are exactly like Derek&#39;s when he was</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.401" end="00:15:28.301" style="s2">little.</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.801" end="00:15:31.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s got to be a coincidence. Lots of</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.301" end="00:15:35.001" style="s2">people look like. We really need to go.</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.701" end="00:15:37.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you doubt it, we can get a DNA test.</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.001" end="00:15:39.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God, one DNA test and he&#39;ll know. But if</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.501" end="00:15:41.900" style="s2">he keeps digging and finds out about the</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.101" end="00:15:43.210" style="s2">other three, I&#39;m screwed.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.900" end="00:15:44.901" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.210" end="00:15:48.201" style="s2">[snorts] Fine, no need for a test.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.901" end="00:15:48.201" style="s2">They&#39;re yours, all of them.</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.501" end="00:15:59.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See, I told you these are my grandkids.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.901" end="00:16:01.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I raised them all by myself for five</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.901" end="00:16:03.501" style="s2">years and now you show up and want to</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.201" end="00:16:05.301" style="s2">take them? No way. I won&#39;t allow it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.501" end="00:16:07.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t know they existed.</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.301" end="00:16:09.901" style="s2">You&#39;ve had it rough all these years.</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.601" end="00:16:11.201" style="s2">This 100 million along with these gifts</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.901" end="00:16:12.501" style="s2">is my way of making it up to you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.201" end="00:16:14.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is this?</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.501" end="00:16:16.401" style="s2">I &#39;m not selling my kids.</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.601" end="00:16:17.801" style="s2">Let me tell you something. You&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.401" end="00:16:18.002" style="s2">taking my children.</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.801" end="00:16:19.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.002" end="00:16:21.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; their father, too.</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.902" end="00:16:23.502" style="s2">If you insist on this,</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.902" end="00:16:24.502" style="s2">I&#39;ll have no choice but to seek custody</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.502" end="00:16:26.402" style="s2">through the courts.</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.502" end="00:16:28.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If he does that, the other three will be</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.402" end="00:16:29.602" style="s2">found, too. I&#39;ll lose all five of my</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.702" end="00:16:31.102" style="s2">babies.</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.602" end="00:16:33.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re willing,</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.102" end="00:16:35.302" style="s2">you and the kids can come back with me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.002" end="00:16:39.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, just take it. Then you won&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.302" end="00:16:39.702" style="s2">to work so hard raising all five.</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.302" end="00:16:43.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m married.</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.602" end="00:16:45.202" style="s2">My husband treats the kids great.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.702" end="00:16:47.002" style="s2">I don&#39;t need this money, and I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.202" end="00:16:49.902" style="s2">handing my children over to you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.002" end="00:16:49.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She has a husband?</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.702" end="00:16:55.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. Nobody&#39;s taking the kids.</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.202" end="00:16:56.402" style="s2">We just want to spend some time with</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.402" end="00:16:57.702" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.402" end="00:17:00.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let the kids stay at my place for a few</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.702" end="00:17:00.802" style="s2">days. Is that okay?</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.202" end="00:17:04.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Just let me say a few words</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.902" end="00:17:06.202" style="s2">to them first.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.802" end="00:17:07.702" style="s2">When you get to Daddy&#39;s house, no</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.202" end="00:17:08.702" style="s2">shifting and no mentioning your three</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.702" end="00:17:11.302" style="s2">brothers.</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.702" end="00:17:12.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why not? Isn&#39;t it better if we all go</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.302" end="00:17:13.702" style="s2">together?</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.302" end="00:17:15.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if he marries that awful woman from</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.702" end="00:17:18.702" style="s2">earlier? She&#39;ll bully you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.902" end="00:17:18.702" style="s2">Remember what I said?</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.902" end="00:17:24.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, babies. Let&#39;s go home with</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.502" end="00:17:24.102" style="s2">Grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.102" end="00:17:28.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Babies, just hang in there for a few</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.902" end="00:17:30.702" style="s2">days.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.902" end="00:17:32.502" style="s2">Mommy has to protect the other three.</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.702" end="00:17:34.902" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry. Mommy will definitely get</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.502" end="00:17:34.902" style="s2">you back.</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.802" end="00:17:45.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow. Is this a castle?</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.202" end="00:17:47.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You like it?</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.702" end="00:17:49.902" style="s2">This is going to be your home from now</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.602" end="00:17:49.902" style="s2">on.</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.502" end="00:17:54.002" style="s2">Look what Grandpa got for you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.702" end="00:18:03.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I dreaming?</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.702" end="00:18:03.902" style="s2">Then don&#39;t wake me up.</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.037" end="00:18:07.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.602" end="00:18:10.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not a dream. It&#39;s all yours.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.902" end="00:18:10.802" style="s2">Take your time eating.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.102" end="00:18:22.303" style="s2">My darlings, you&#39;ve been through so much</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.703" end="00:18:22.303" style="s2">all these years.</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.342" end="00:18:26.503" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.203" end="00:18:27.903" style="s2">Keep eating.</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.503" end="00:18:29.003" style="s2">Grandpap&#39;s going to pick out some new</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.903" end="00:18:31.103" style="s2">clothes for you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.003" end="00:18:33.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy and grandpa are so nice. I wish</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.103" end="00:18:35.803" style="s2">mommy and my brothers were here, too.</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.303" end="00:18:35.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brothers?</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.503" end="00:18:43.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy said not to talk about our</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.003" end="00:18:43.503" style="s2">brothers.</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.303" end="00:18:53.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy!</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.303" end="00:19:00.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You guys did all this?</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.003" end="00:19:03.303" style="s2">Taking care of me at such a young age.</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.603" end="00:19:05.303" style="s2">They&#39;ve really suffered being with me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.303" end="00:19:07.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, where are Theo and Nina?</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.303" end="00:19:09.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Babies, I&#39;ve got something to tell you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.803" end="00:19:11.503" style="s2">We found daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.803" end="00:19:12.503" style="s2">Nina and Theo went to daddy&#39;s house.</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.503" end="00:19:15.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DADDY!</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.503" end="00:19:15.603" style="s2">CAN we go see him?</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.303" end="00:19:25.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t even use a knife and fork. How</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.003" end="00:19:28.103" style="s2">are you supposed to be an Aston? If you</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.703" end="00:19:30.303" style="s2">can&#39;t learn, you don&#39;t eat.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.103" end="00:19:31.903" style="s2">Sit up straight. NO CRYING. DON&#39;T</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.303" end="00:19:34.203" style="s2">EMBARRASS THE FAMILY.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.903" end="00:19:34.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOMMY, HELP!</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.703" end="00:19:38.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO WAY. DADDY&#39;S house is no joke. Nina</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.303" end="00:19:39.703" style="s2">and Theo are definitely going to suffer</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.903" end="00:19:41.703" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.703" end="00:19:42.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So does that mean we&#39;ll never see them</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.703" end="00:19:44.003" style="s2">again?</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.403" end="00:19:47.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.003" end="00:19:47.503" style="s2">Mommy will definitely get them back.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.503" end="00:19:55.003" style="s2">What if Theo and Nina really aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.903" end="00:19:58.303" style="s2">doing well?</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.003" end="00:19:58.303" style="s2">I need to video call them right now.</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.703" end="00:20:01.803" style="s2">They&#39;ve never been away from me this</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.703" end="00:20:03.503" style="s2">long.</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.803" end="00:20:06.203" style="s2">Will they miss me? Will Derek&#39;s family</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.503" end="00:20:06.203" style="s2">be mean to them?</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.903" end="00:20:13.003" style="s2">Oh my god, how can there be such a cute</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.003" end="00:20:13.003" style="s2">little sweetheart?</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.603" end="00:20:17.603" style="s2">Young master Theo is so romantic. Who</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.303" end="00:20:20.103" style="s2">knows how many girls he&#39;ll charm when he</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.603" end="00:20:20.103" style="s2">grows up.</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.503" end="00:20:22.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.303" end="00:20:24.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.503" end="00:20:26.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you guys eaten?</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.005" end="00:20:29.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you okay over there?</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.905" end="00:20:30.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re eating so well. Everything is</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.305" end="00:20:32.205" style="s2">delicious.</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.305" end="00:20:34.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.205" end="00:20:35.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nina, do you have toys to play with? Is</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.305" end="00:20:36.305" style="s2">grandpa making you follow a bunch of</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.505" end="00:20:38.705" style="s2">rules?</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.305" end="00:20:40.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nope. Grandpa just lets us pick whatever</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.705" end="00:20:42.105" style="s2">we like.</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.105" end="00:20:42.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s good. Be good. Don&#39;t make grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.105" end="00:20:44.905" style="s2">angry. Is</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.705" end="00:20:47.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Babies, grandpa turned the backyard into</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.905" end="00:20:48.905" style="s2">a playground. Come see if YOU LIKE IT.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.305" end="00:20:51.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOMMY, WE&#39;LL TALK LATER. WE&#39;RE GOING TO</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.905" end="00:20:52.505" style="s2">PLAY.</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.205" end="00:20:56.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; OKAY.</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.505" end="00:20:56.205" style="s2">So it was just me worrying for nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.005" end="00:21:02.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ceo, didn&#39;t mommy say daddy&#39;s house</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.805" end="00:21:05.105" style="s2">wasn&#39;t simple?</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.805" end="00:21:07.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s really not simple. There&#39;s so much</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.105" end="00:21:09.305" style="s2">fun stuff. Hurry up and think of a way</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.205" end="00:21:12.605" style="s2">to bring mommy over so we can all live</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.305" end="00:21:12.605" style="s2">the good life together.</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.005" end="00:21:19.905" style="s2">Ceo, I&#39;ll sneak over to see you</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.605" end="00:21:21.905" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.905" end="00:21:24.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re going to betray mommy? We found</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.905" end="00:21:25.705" style="s2">dad so mommy could take it easy.</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.505" end="00:21:28.205" style="s2">Shouldn&#39;t we hurry up and get them</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.705" end="00:21:28.205" style="s2">together?</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.705" end="00:21:32.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, your phone&#39;s practically touching</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.305" end="00:21:33.305" style="s2">your nose.</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.405" end="00:21:35.205" style="s2">Tomorrow you&#39;re coming with me to the</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.305" end="00:21:38.805" style="s2">hospital to get your eyes checked.</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.205" end="00:21:38.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, can I not go?</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.405" end="00:21:50.105" style="s2">Grandpa, where are we going today?</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.505" end="00:21:50.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.305" end="00:21:55.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay right here, Noah. Mommy&#39;s going to</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.805" end="00:21:58.005" style="s2">pay.</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.605" end="00:21:59.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.005" end="00:22:01.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. No shots.</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.905" end="00:22:02.605" style="s2">Grandpa just wants to see how to fatten</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.305" end="00:22:03.805" style="s2">you up a bit.</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.605" end="00:22:04.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My tummy hurts. I need to go to the</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.805" end="00:22:07.505" style="s2">bathroom.</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.505" end="00:22:07.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finn, watch Nina. I&#39;ll take him.</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.305" end="00:22:11.405" style="s2">Huh? Ceo&#39;s here too?</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.505" end="00:22:20.205" style="s2">Ceo, that was fast.</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.305" end="00:22:21.905" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me you don&#39;t want to get</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.205" end="00:22:24.905" style="s2">checked and you&#39;re trying to sneak off.</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.905" end="00:22:26.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you? Mommy, help.</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.905" end="00:22:28.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m your grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.605" end="00:22:30.006" style="s2">Ceo, why are you wearing glasses?</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.506" end="00:22:32.006" style="s2">And you look a little different too.</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.006" end="00:22:32.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa, are you sure your eyesight&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.006" end="00:22:35.806" style="s2">okay?</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.906" end="00:22:38.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He knows Theo?</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.806" end="00:22:38.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no.</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.906" end="00:22:43.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ella, perfect timing.</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.006" end="00:22:46.306" style="s2">Theo suddenly doesn&#39;t even recognize his</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.606" end="00:22:46.306" style="s2">own grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.506" end="00:22:51.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, help.</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.906" end="00:22:51.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no, he mistook Noah for Theo.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.306" end="00:22:57.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I get it. Theo, you&#39;re messing with</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.406" end="00:22:58.806" style="s2">grandpa again? You almost got me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.406" end="00:23:00.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, he&#39;s just playing with you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.806" end="00:23:01.106" style="s2">Sweetie, say hi to grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.106" end="00:23:02.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.106" end="00:23:03.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But it&#39;s weird.</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.406" end="00:23:04.906" style="s2">Something feels off.</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.706" end="00:23:05.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you at the hospital? Are you</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.906" end="00:23:06.906" style="s2">feeling unwell?</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.306" end="00:23:08.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. I just brought the kids for a</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.906" end="00:23:10.306" style="s2">checkup. What about you?</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.706" end="00:23:12.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I just came for a checkup. I haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.306" end="00:23:14.006" style="s2">been feeling great lately.</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.206" end="00:23:15.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is Derek giving you too much work? I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.006" end="00:23:17.306" style="s2">talk to him when I get back.</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.606" end="00:23:19.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, it&#39;s got nothing to do with him.</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.306" end="00:23:21.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make excuses for him.</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.706" end="00:23:23.706" style="s2">You gave our family two lovely pups. He</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.506" end="00:23:26.106" style="s2">owes you proper care.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.706" end="00:23:29.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really, it&#39;s fine. You go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.106" end="00:23:29.606" style="s2">I just need to talk to my kid for a sec.</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.506" end="00:23:33.506" style="s2">I got to get Noah out of here fast or</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.306" end="00:23:34.706" style="s2">I&#39;ll lose another one.</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.506" end="00:23:37.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy,</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.706" end="00:23:37.706" style="s2">what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.006" end="00:23:51.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two Theos? No, who are you really?</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.406" end="00:23:54.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His name is Noah.</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.706" end="00:23:55.506" style="s2">This one&#39;s Theo.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.406" end="00:23:58.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.506" end="00:24:00.506" style="s2">you had triplets?</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.306" end="00:24:01.806" style="s2">Two grandson and a granddaughter. Oh my</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.506" end="00:24:03.306" style="s2">god, I&#39;m this lucky.</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.806" end="00:24:06.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t mean to hide it from you. I was</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.306" end="00:24:06.706" style="s2">just scared you&#39;d take my kids away.</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.906" end="00:24:13.106" style="s2">Please, just don&#39;t tell Derek yet, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.706" end="00:24:18.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. I promise I won&#39;t tell him</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.506" end="00:24:20.706" style="s2">for now. Just let me see the kids in</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.506" end="00:24:21.606" style="s2">secret.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.706" end="00:24:23.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.606" end="00:24:26.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After the checkup, want to hit the mall</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.706" end="00:24:26.206" style="s2">together?</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.806" end="00:24:31.807" style="s2">I&#39;ve been waiting years for grandkids,</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.107" end="00:24:35.107" style="s2">and now three show up at once. I JUST</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.807" end="00:24:35.107" style="s2">WANT TO SPOIL THEM.</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.908" end="00:24:42.336" style="s2">ONE, TWO, THREE.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.316" end="00:24:42.336" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.408" end="00:24:53.807" style="s2">DEREK, you have three kids. Ella had</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.107" end="00:24:53.807" style="s2">triplets.</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.207" end="00:24:58.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three?</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.707" end="00:24:58.908" style="s2">Dad, are you dreaming?</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.908" end="00:25:04.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I counted them myself. We&#39;re heading to</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.207" end="00:25:06.908" style="s2">the mall now. Get over here and see for</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.307" end="00:25:06.908" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.107" end="00:25:20.007" style="s2">Not these. Wrap up everything else for</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.408" end="00:25:21.908" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.007" end="00:25:23.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Ashton, that&#39;s way too much. The</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.908" end="00:25:24.707" style="s2">kids can&#39;t possibly wear all this.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.507" end="00:25:28.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then they&#39;ll wear something different</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.707" end="00:25:28.607" style="s2">every day. Come on, next store.</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.707" end="00:25:38.207" style="s2">See anything you like? Grandpa&#39;s paying.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.807" end="00:25:42.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously, that&#39;s enough. There won&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.307" end="00:25:44.408" style="s2">any room left to put it all.</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.207" end="00:25:45.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is nothing. If there&#39;s no room,</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.408" end="00:25:47.908" style="s2">I&#39;ll just buy them a villa for their</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.807" end="00:25:50.007" style="s2">toys.</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.908" end="00:25:53.307" style="s2">The kids all got something. Now it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.007" end="00:25:53.307" style="s2">your turn to pick something out.</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.607" end="00:26:00.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Ashton, no, I can&#39;t. This is way too</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.908" end="00:26:02.807" style="s2">expensive.</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.707" end="00:26:05.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be polite with me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.807" end="00:26:06.408" style="s2">All of this should be yours. Wrap it up.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.807" end="00:26:10.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.408" end="00:26:10.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait here a bit. I&#39;ll go pay.</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.607" end="00:26:21.307" style="s2">That kid Derek, why isn&#39;t he here yet?</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.207" end="00:26:21.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Wood, welcome.</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.707" end="00:26:32.009" style="s2">Babies, are you tired? Sit here and rest</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.707" end="00:26:32.009" style="s2">for a bit.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.109" end="00:26:36.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How come there&#39;s another one?</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.109" end="00:26:38.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ella, are you a sour something? You</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.009" end="00:26:38.709" style="s2">actually had three?</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.309" end="00:26:42.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; None of your business. I bet you want to</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.909" end="00:26:45.009" style="s2">have Derek&#39;s kids, but he probably</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.109" end="00:26:45.009" style="s2">doesn&#39;t even want you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.209" end="00:26:48.109" style="s2">Don&#39;t think having three kids means you</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.409" end="00:26:50.663" style="s2">can marry into the Ashton family. The</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.109" end="00:26:51.309" style="s2">daughter-in-law his mom approved is me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.663" end="00:26:52.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.309" end="00:26:54.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then go marry him. Why are you yelling</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.809" end="00:26:55.209" style="s2">at me?</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.309" end="00:26:56.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re clinging to him with your kids</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.209" end="00:26:59.809" style="s2">and you still dare say you&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.109" end="00:26:59.809" style="s2">stealing my man, you shameless</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.009" end="00:27:15.909" style="s2">Get this and her little brat out</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.509" end="00:27:17.409" style="s2">of here right now.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.909" end="00:27:19.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But she just bought our newest necklace.</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.409" end="00:27:20.609" style="s2">She&#39;s already a VIP.</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.409" end="00:27:22.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s nothing but a spinning my</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.609" end="00:27:23.709" style="s2">fiance&#39;s money.</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.009" end="00:27:25.309" style="s2">I&#39;m the future boss lady here. Whose</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.709" end="00:27:27.309" style="s2">side are you on?</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.309" end="00:27:28.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, please leave.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.309" end="00:27:29.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Being the boss lady means you can just</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.509" end="00:27:31.209" style="s2">kick customers out? Don&#39;t you have any</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.809" end="00:27:32.609" style="s2">rules here? You&#39;re nothing but a lowly</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.209" end="00:27:34.709" style="s2">woman. How dare you compare yourself to</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.609" end="00:27:35.909" style="s2">our future boss lady. Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.709" end="00:27:37.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch my mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.909" end="00:27:38.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brat, who said you could stop</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.309" end="00:27:41.109" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.909" end="00:27:41.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way.</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.009" end="00:27:46.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad wasn&#39;t wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.709" end="00:27:49.609" style="s2">They really are triplets.</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.409" end="00:27:49.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no, he found another one.</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.009" end="00:27:55.709" style="s2">Mr. Ashton?</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.509" end="00:27:56.809" style="s2">Derek? What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.709" end="00:27:58.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I hadn&#39;t shown up, you&#39;d still be</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.809" end="00:28:00.409" style="s2">bullying my children?</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.109" end="00:28:01.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re your children?</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.409" end="00:28:04.509" style="s2">But Miss Wood said she was the future</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.609" end="00:28:04.509" style="s2">boss lady, so I</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.509" end="00:28:10.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who gave you the right to use our store</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.209" end="00:28:12.709" style="s2">to bully our kids?</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.509" end="00:28:14.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Ashton, it&#39;s not what you think.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.709" end="00:28:16.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Blair,</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.409" end="00:28:18.809" style="s2">from now on every Ashton-owned store is</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.209" end="00:28:21.409" style="s2">off limits to you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.809" end="00:28:23.709" style="s2">And you, whoever has money and power,</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.409" end="00:28:25.709" style="s2">you listen to them.</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.709" end="00:28:27.309" style="s2">And you dare lay hands on a child,</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.709" end="00:28:28.409" style="s2">you&#39;re fired.</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.309" end="00:28:29.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I really didn&#39;t know they were your</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.409" end="00:28:33.509" style="s2">children.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.709" end="00:28:33.509" style="s2">Please, just give me another chance.</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.809" end="00:28:39.210" style="s2">Derek, your mom adores me. You can&#39;t do</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.010" end="00:28:41.310" style="s2">this to me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.210" end="00:28:43.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Escort her out. Ms. Wood, this way,</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.310" end="00:28:43.710" style="s2">please.</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.634" end="00:28:46.654" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.210" end="00:28:52.110" style="s2">Did I say you could leave?</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.494" end="00:28:56.810" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.110" end="00:28:59.710" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you say you only had two kids?</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.810" end="00:28:59.710" style="s2">So you lied me?</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.110" end="00:29:04.310" style="s2">Why did you lie to me?</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.710" end="00:29:05.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, I was scared you&#39;d take all my</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.310" end="00:29:06.410" style="s2">kids away.</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.110" end="00:29:07.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So just three total? You sure there</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.410" end="00:29:08.410" style="s2">aren&#39;t any more?</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.110" end="00:29:10.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, just three, really.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.410" end="00:29:12.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, isn&#39;t there also</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.710" end="00:29:14.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, I believe you. I&#39;ll drive you home</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.610" end="00:29:15.310" style="s2">and pay a visit while I&#39;m at it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.010" end="00:29:16.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need.</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.310" end="00:29:18.010" style="s2">If you come, the other two won&#39;t stay</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.810" end="00:29:19.710" style="s2">hidden.</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.010" end="00:29:21.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What, is it inconvenient?</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.710" end="00:29:22.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My husband&#39;s home.</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.110" end="00:29:24.710" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid he won&#39;t be happy about it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.910" end="00:29:28.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, since when do you have a</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.710" end="00:29:28.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetie, you want some candy, don&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.710" end="00:29:33.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you just say?</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.710" end="00:29:36.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Ashton, we&#39;ll be going now. Thanks</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.410" end="00:29:37.410" style="s2">for today.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.110" end="00:29:40.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Derek,</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.410" end="00:29:42.310" style="s2">don&#39;t you dare give Ella a hard time.</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.610" end="00:29:44.610" style="s2">But can Noah stay with me for a few</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.310" end="00:29:44.610" style="s2">days?</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.910" end="00:29:47.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Another one gone.</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.610" end="00:29:50.410" style="s2">I just can&#39;t let the other two get</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.910" end="00:29:50.410" style="s2">discovered.</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.510" end="00:29:58.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Find out if Ella&#39;s married.</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.510" end="00:30:00.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ella, just you wait. I&#39;ll get you away</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.010" end="00:30:01.510" style="s2">from Derek sooner or later.</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.610" end="00:30:03.410" style="s2">Hello?</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.510" end="00:30:07.410" style="s2">Keep a close eye on Ella at the office.</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.410" end="00:30:07.410" style="s2">I want her gone by the end of the day.</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.810" end="00:30:14.610" style="s2">Mommy&#39;s going to work now.</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.510" end="00:30:17.210" style="s2">Be good at home. No running off. Got it?</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.610" end="00:30:17.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.310" end="00:30:23.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When are we going to be reunited with</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.110" end="00:30:23.510" style="s2">Daddy?</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.110" end="00:30:27.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Director, I heard anyone in the company</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.110" end="00:30:29.810" style="s2">can enter the Christmas-themed design</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.610" end="00:30:33.410" style="s2">competition. I used to work in fashion</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.810" end="00:30:33.410" style="s2">too, and I&#39;d like to submit something.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.610" end="00:30:36.712" style="s2">So this is the who&#39;s fighting</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.010" end="00:30:39.212" style="s2">Blair over the president.</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.712" end="00:30:42.012" style="s2">Hm. Once I get rid of her, Blair will</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.212" end="00:30:43.512" style="s2">definitely make sure I rise to the top.</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.012" end="00:30:45.212" style="s2">Ella Jones,</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.512" end="00:30:47.512" style="s2">you&#39;re the one who dropped out because</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.212" end="00:30:48.612" style="s2">you got pregnant?</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.512" end="00:30:50.712" style="s2">What does that have to do with my</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.612" end="00:30:53.112" style="s2">design?</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.712" end="00:30:55.912" style="s2">Any trash thinks they can join in. Do I</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.112" end="00:30:57.512" style="s2">look like I have time for this?</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.912" end="00:30:58.612" style="s2">Since you don&#39;t want to look at it, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.512" end="00:31:01.812" style="s2">just give it to the competition</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.612" end="00:31:03.912" style="s2">coordinator. Submissions go through me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.812" end="00:31:07.412" style="s2">Go back and do your job as an assistant.</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.912" end="00:31:07.412" style="s2">Fetching coffee, that&#39;s your job.</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.012" end="00:31:13.012" style="s2">She can actually design something like</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.612" end="00:31:13.012" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:31:16.712" end="00:31:21.312" style="s2">My design got selected. The winner of</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.712" end="00:31:24.812" style="s2">this internal design competition.</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.312" end="00:31:24.812" style="s2">Design director, Fiona.</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.112" end="00:31:32.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This piece is innovative, better than</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.712" end="00:31:34.212" style="s2">the last few years.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.212" end="00:31:36.412" style="s2">Fiona, well done.</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.212" end="00:31:38.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Mr. Ashton. I poured my heart</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.412" end="00:31:38.912" style="s2">into it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.112" end="00:31:42.112" style="s2">Hold on.</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.012" end="00:31:45.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.112" end="00:31:45.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my design.</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.912" end="00:31:50.612" style="s2">I clearly drew this.</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.012" end="00:31:52.412" style="s2">I graduated from the French Fashion</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.612" end="00:31:53.812" style="s2">Design Institute.</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.412" end="00:31:55.912" style="s2">You didn&#39;t even finish college and</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.812" end="00:31:57.512" style="s2">you&#39;re saying I copied you?</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.912" end="00:31:59.212" style="s2">Who&#39;s going to believe that?</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.512" end="00:32:01.512" style="s2">Not graduating doesn&#39;t mean I&#39;m worse</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.212" end="00:32:03.312" style="s2">than you. Then show me proof. If you</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.512" end="00:32:04.312" style="s2">can&#39;t, it&#39;s slander.</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.312" end="00:32:06.712" style="s2">Please zoom in on the lines of the</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.312" end="00:32:09.212" style="s2">skirt.</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.712" end="00:32:11.312" style="s2">I always hide my initials in my designs.</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.212" end="00:32:15.612" style="s2">EJ, Ella Jones.</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.312" end="00:32:15.612" style="s2">Director, your name isn&#39;t that, is it?</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.412" end="00:32:20.312" style="s2">I can&#39;t believe a design director would</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.912" end="00:32:21.812" style="s2">steal a junior employee&#39;s work. How</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.312" end="00:32:22.912" style="s2">shameless.</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.812" end="00:32:24.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fiona,</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.912" end="00:32:25.712" style="s2">as design director, you stole someone</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.312" end="00:32:28.512" style="s2">else&#39;s work.</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.712" end="00:32:30.412" style="s2">You&#39;re done in this position.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.512" end="00:32:31.912" style="s2">As for you, starting tomorrow, transfer</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.412" end="00:32:33.512" style="s2">to the design department. Start as an</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.912" end="00:32:36.507" style="s2">assistant designer.</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.512" end="00:32:36.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? I get to do design?</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.507" end="00:32:38.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.712" end="00:32:39.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You earned this yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.212" end="00:32:40.413" style="s2">Besides, you&#39;re the mother of my</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.313" end="00:32:41.413" style="s2">children.</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.413" end="00:32:42.413" style="s2">I can&#39;t just let your talent go to</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.413" end="00:32:45.413" style="s2">waste.</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.413" end="00:32:45.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Mr. Ashton.</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.332" end="00:32:50.013" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.813" end="00:32:51.313" style="s2">Noah, mommy finally gets to do the job</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.013" end="00:32:52.413" style="s2">she loves.</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.313" end="00:32:54.413" style="s2">Are you guys having fun at grandpa&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.413" end="00:32:56.113" style="s2">house?</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.413" end="00:32:59.713" style="s2">Mommy?</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.113" end="00:32:59.713" style="s2">What happened? Mommy!</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.513" end="00:33:06.513" style="s2">Fiona, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.513" end="00:33:08.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all your fault, you You made</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.513" end="00:33:11.513" style="s2">me lose face and get demoted.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.613" end="00:33:13.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You stole my design and framed me, and</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.513" end="00:33:14.913" style="s2">now it&#39;s my fault?</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.113" end="00:33:17.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m doing you a favor by using your</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.913" end="00:33:19.213" style="s2">design. Quit on your own tomorrow, or</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.113" end="00:33:21.613" style="s2">don&#39;t blame me for what happens. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.213" end="00:33:24.013" style="s2">try anything. There are cameras here. I</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.613" end="00:33:26.813" style="s2">already checked. No cameras and no one&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.013" end="00:33:26.813" style="s2">coming to save you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.013" end="00:33:32.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, someone took mommy. I know where</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.313" end="00:33:34.513" style="s2">mommy is. My watch has her location.</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.313" end="00:33:37.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my pup. Smart.</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.513" end="00:33:37.013" style="s2">Come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.913" end="00:33:48.613" style="s2">No cameras?</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.813" end="00:33:53.713" style="s2">You dare hit me?</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.713" end="00:33:55.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You picked the spot yourself. Why should</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.713" end="00:33:57.013" style="s2">I hold back?</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.013" end="00:33:58.913" style="s2">You think I&#39;m easy to push around?</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.013" end="00:34:00.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m one of Miss Woods&#39; people.</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.913" end="00:34:03.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She got kicked out of the company. You</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.513" end="00:34:03.713" style="s2">think she can still back you up?</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.013" end="00:34:06.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of Ella.</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.613" end="00:34:12.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.813" end="00:34:14.513" style="s2">Miss Jones doesn&#39;t seem like the one in</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.113" end="00:34:17.113" style="s2">danger here.</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.513" end="00:34:19.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy hits people and she&#39;s still this</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.113" end="00:34:19.813" style="s2">good at it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.613" end="00:34:25.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little how dare you do this</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.713" end="00:34:27.713" style="s2">to me?</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.713" end="00:34:29.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should thank you actually.</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.713" end="00:34:30.913" style="s2">You found a nice quiet place for me to</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.613" end="00:34:33.613" style="s2">fight back.</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.913" end="00:34:33.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy!</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.213" end="00:34:39.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.513" end="00:34:42.813" style="s2">Mr. Ashton, you&#39;re here</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.914" end="00:34:47.014" style="s2">Mr. Aston, save me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.314" end="00:34:48.214" style="s2">Look what Ella did to me. You have TO</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.014" end="00:34:50.414" style="s2">STAND UP FOR ME.</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.214" end="00:34:53.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make stuff up. Do you have proof?</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.414" end="00:34:53.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Aston, I&#39;m very classy. I never hit</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.114" end="00:34:56.679" style="s2">people.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.714" end="00:34:57.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, Daddy saw everything just now.</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.679" end="00:34:59.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.314" end="00:35:00.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She started it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.114" end="00:35:02.114" style="s2">She said she was Blair&#39;s people and</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.614" end="00:35:04.614" style="s2">tried to force me to quit.</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.114" end="00:35:07.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody put me up to it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.614" end="00:35:08.414" style="s2">I just don&#39;t like her.</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.114" end="00:35:09.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you dragged her down here to beat her</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.414" end="00:35:10.814" style="s2">up?</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.914" end="00:35:12.014" style="s2">Finn,</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.814" end="00:35:13.214" style="s2">call the police.</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.014" end="00:35:16.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.214" end="00:35:17.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. Blair told me to get rid of Ella.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.114" end="00:35:20.414" style="s2">I&#39;ll tell you everything. Just don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.714" end="00:35:20.414" style="s2">call the police.</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.569" end="00:35:25.514" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.114" end="00:35:26.514" style="s2">Mr. Aston, sorry to trouble you again</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.514" end="00:35:27.414" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.514" end="00:35:29.814" style="s2">We&#39;ll be going now.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.414" end="00:35:29.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.914" end="00:35:35.714" style="s2">Your hand&#39;s bleeding.</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.214" end="00:35:36.714" style="s2">Get in the car. I&#39;ll bandage it for you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.714" end="00:35:39.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just a scratch.</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.714" end="00:35:39.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t argue.</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.114" end="00:35:44.614" style="s2">Did I hurt you?</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.814" end="00:35:47.414" style="s2">I&#39;ll be gentler.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.114" end="00:35:54.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t expect him to be so serious</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.714" end="00:35:56.714" style="s2">looking, yet so gentle.</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.214" end="00:35:56.714" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.914" end="00:36:03.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, Daddy, you guys are so close.</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.214" end="00:36:07.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want me to drive you home?</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.314" end="00:36:09.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.714" end="00:36:11.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.514" end="00:36:13.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are still two kids at home. If you</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.214" end="00:36:15.014" style="s2">come, that&#39;s it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.114" end="00:36:16.714" style="s2">My husband&#39;s home. I&#39;m afraid he won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.014" end="00:36:18.914" style="s2">be happy.</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.714" end="00:36:20.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sounds like you two are doing well.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.914" end="00:36:22.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, we&#39;re great. I&#39;ll take all the</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.414" end="00:36:24.514" style="s2">kids home today.</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.214" end="00:36:26.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that awful woman didn&#39;t just bully</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.514" end="00:36:30.114" style="s2">you at the mall? She got someone to</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.414" end="00:36:30.114" style="s2">bully Mommy at work, too?</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.014" end="00:36:37.914" style="s2">We can&#39;t just let this go. I&#39;m going to</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.314" end="00:36:37.914" style="s2">get revenge for you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.814" end="00:36:43.114" style="s2">But how are you going to do it?</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.214" end="00:36:45.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.114" end="00:36:48.116" style="s2">Obviously, I&#39;m going to go to that awful</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.716" end="00:36:50.116" style="s2">woman&#39;s house and settle the score.</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.116" end="00:36:52.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But Alex won&#39;t agree to that.</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.116" end="00:36:53.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Milo can&#39;t go alone. Theo, Noah, you go</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.916" end="00:36:56.516" style="s2">with him.</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.616" end="00:36:59.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Useless. You can&#39;t even get rid of Ella.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.516" end="00:36:59.816" style="s2">Think of something else now.</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.916" end="00:37:04.516" style="s2">Ella, if it weren&#39;t for you, I&#39;d already</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.516" end="00:37:06.116" style="s2">been married to Derek.</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.516" end="00:37:09.216" style="s2">I&#39;ll destroy you and those three little</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.116" end="00:37:11.016" style="s2">brats sooner or later.</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.216" end="00:37:12.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t go out there. If we get caught</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.016" end="00:37:15.316" style="s2">now, we&#39;re done for.</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.916" end="00:37:18.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do we do? We can&#39;t get revenge</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.316" end="00:37:21.016" style="s2">if we don&#39;t get close to her.</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.116" end="00:37:21.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got an idea.</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.516" end="00:37:32.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just you two? Where are Milo and the</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.216" end="00:37:32.616" style="s2">others?</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.316" end="00:37:38.116" style="s2">What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.916" end="00:37:38.116" style="s2">You can&#39;t hide things from Mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.516" end="00:37:42.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, they went to get revenge on the</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.416" end="00:37:45.116" style="s2">bad woman, and I said it was okay.</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.716" end="00:37:45.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.916" end="00:38:04.516" style="s2">Who&#39;s there?</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.516" end="00:38:04.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Turn back quick. Don&#39;t let her see you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.816" end="00:38:14.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You again? Guards!</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.216" end="00:38:22.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, help! Bad people caught us.</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.116" end="00:38:26.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brats, I finally caught you</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.916" end="00:38:29.316" style="s2">in the act. Derek will definitely take</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.716" end="00:38:29.316" style="s2">my side.</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.516" end="00:38:32.716" style="s2">Wait, who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.016" end="00:38:37.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You bad woman, who said you could bully</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.416" end="00:38:40.016" style="s2">them?</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.216" end="00:38:43.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brat, you dare curse at me?</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.016" end="00:38:43.716" style="s2">JUST YOU WAIT. STOP RIGHT THERE.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.716" end="00:38:50.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOMMY!</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.917" end="00:38:53.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOMMY?</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.117" end="00:38:55.317" style="s2">He&#39;s your son, too?</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.817" end="00:38:57.217" style="s2">How do you have another one?</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.317" end="00:38:58.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; None of your business.</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.217" end="00:39:02.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think you can just mess me up like</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.717" end="00:39:05.117" style="s2">this and leave? Take them all inside.</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.917" end="00:39:07.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me. DON&#39;T TOUCH MY KIDS.</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.117" end="00:39:07.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOMMY, MOMMY.</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.717" end="00:39:19.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s another one?</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.517" end="00:39:19.317" style="s2">Ella, how many kids did you have for me?</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.817" end="00:39:24.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Milo.</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.917" end="00:39:24.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.577" end="00:39:27.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.517" end="00:39:30.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it, why is he here? Now Milo&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.617" end="00:39:30.717" style="s2">going to be discovered, too.</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.117" end="00:39:41.517" style="s2">Don&#39;t move, baby. Let mommy see.</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.917" end="00:39:46.817" style="s2">Derek, they sprayed me with the hose</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.817" end="00:39:48.417" style="s2">first. I just wanted to teach them a</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.817" end="00:39:49.817" style="s2">lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.417" end="00:39:51.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s because you bullied mommy and hit</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.817" end="00:39:52.817" style="s2">me. Milo just came to help us get</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.617" end="00:39:57.117" style="s2">revenge.</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.817" end="00:39:57.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brat. Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.617" end="00:40:03.877" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You dare hit my son right in front of</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.117" end="00:40:05.317" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.877" end="00:40:06.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.317" end="00:40:08.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Derek,</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.317" end="00:40:09.717" style="s2">I&#39;m not usually like this. They were</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.017" end="00:40:11.817" style="s2">deliberately provoking me.</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.717" end="00:40:15.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. If you dare lay a hand on them</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.817" end="00:40:15.517" style="s2">again, I won&#39;t let it slide.</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.317" end="00:40:30.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.317" end="00:40:32.617" style="s2">Weren&#39;t there three kids before? How</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.117" end="00:40:33.917" style="s2">come there&#39;s another one now?</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.617" end="00:40:36.617" style="s2">Could it be</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.917" end="00:40:38.417" style="s2">Ella had quadruplets?</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.617" end="00:40:40.917" style="s2">Now he&#39;s found another one. What do I</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.417" end="00:40:40.917" style="s2">do?</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.417" end="00:40:47.517" style="s2">Does it still hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.817" end="00:40:49.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, it doesn&#39;t hurt anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.517" end="00:40:52.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more sneaking out, you hear me?</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.618" end="00:40:54.118" style="s2">Today was way too dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.418" end="00:40:56.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The doctor said Milo&#39;s fine. Just keep</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.118" end="00:40:58.618" style="s2">the wound dry for a few days.</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.718" end="00:41:01.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.618" end="00:41:01.318" style="s2">We&#39;ll be going now.</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.518" end="00:41:05.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No moon mark.</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.118" end="00:41:06.318" style="s2">What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.318" end="00:41:07.118" style="s2">Ella, is there something you&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.318" end="00:41:07.918" style="s2">telling me?</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.118" end="00:41:09.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.918" end="00:41:11.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You told me before you only had three</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.318" end="00:41:14.018" style="s2">kids. So what about Milo?</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.618" end="00:41:15.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s adopted. He&#39;s not your child. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.018" end="00:41:16.618" style="s2">overthink it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.818" end="00:41:19.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adopted?</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.618" end="00:41:21.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. We&#39;re leaving now.</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.418" end="00:41:24.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The mark doesn&#39;t prove anything, but</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.418" end="00:41:24.418" style="s2">blood doesn&#39;t lie.</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.118" end="00:41:31.818" style="s2">This is Milo&#39;s blood. Run a paternity</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.118" end="00:41:34.318" style="s2">test against mine. Give it to the pack</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.818" end="00:41:34.318" style="s2">physician.</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.818" end="00:41:39.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s doing a paternity test? If this</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.018" end="00:41:40.518" style="s2">fourth one is his too, I won&#39;t stand a</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.218" end="00:41:45.218" style="s2">chance.</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.518" end="00:41:45.218" style="s2">No. I absolutely won&#39;t allow it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.718" end="00:41:53.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get in. I&#39;ll drive you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.618" end="00:41:55.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need. We&#39;ll just grab a cab.</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.118" end="00:41:56.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you get one yet?</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.418" end="00:41:59.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Almost.</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.618" end="00:42:03.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not tired, but the kid must be.</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.218" end="00:42:03.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, I&#39;m so sleepy.</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.818" end="00:42:18.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re here. You can head back now.</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.918" end="00:42:20.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No rush. I&#39;ll walk you in. Open the</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.218" end="00:42:20.418" style="s2">door.</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.818" end="00:42:27.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey girl, you live next door.</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.704" end="00:42:27.918" style="s2">[snorts] Sorry, wrong door.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.918" end="00:42:34.918" style="s2">The place isn&#39;t picked up yet. Sorry, I</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.318" end="00:42:37.318" style="s2">can&#39;t invite you in. You should go.</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.918" end="00:42:39.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No rush. I can wait. You&#39;re this</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.318" end="00:42:41.618" style="s2">nervous.</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.818" end="00:42:44.418" style="s2">What other secret are you hiding at home</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.618" end="00:42:44.418" style="s2">that you can&#39;t tell me?</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.718" end="00:42:49.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.318" end="00:42:49.818" style="s2">Why is he standing so close?</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.520" end="00:42:59.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, what are you doing at the door?</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.920" end="00:43:05.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, why&#39;s your face so red?</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.420" end="00:43:07.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just a little hot. What are you guys</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.420" end="00:43:08.220" style="s2">doing out here?</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.279" end="00:43:12.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.220" end="00:43:12.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard Daddy&#39;s voice. Daddy, come in.</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.620" end="00:43:22.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you miss Daddy?</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.120" end="00:43:24.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YES.</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.520" end="00:43:26.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WAIT, I haven&#39;t even invited you in yet.</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.720" end="00:43:29.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The kids invited me. I can&#39;t exactly say</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.720" end="00:43:29.220" style="s2">no, can I?</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.220" end="00:43:34.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex really is the most levelheaded.</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.220" end="00:43:35.220" style="s2">He&#39;s hiding well.</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.320" end="00:43:36.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So,</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.220" end="00:43:39.020" style="s2">explain.</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.620" end="00:43:41.120" style="s2">How many kids did you actually have?</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.020" end="00:43:44.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just just three.</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.120" end="00:43:45.720" style="s2">Milo really is adopted.</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.320" end="00:43:48.120" style="s2">You don&#39;t believe me? I&#39;ll show you the</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.720" end="00:43:48.120" style="s2">proof.</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.520" end="00:43:56.620" style="s2">These are Milo&#39;s adoption papers. And</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.320" end="00:43:59.920" style="s2">you never believed I was married, right?</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.620" end="00:43:59.920" style="s2">Here&#39;s the marriage certificate, too.</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.120" end="00:44:05.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got everything prepared. It</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.520" end="00:44:05.320" style="s2">actually looks legit.</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.020" end="00:44:12.920" style="s2">Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.220" end="00:44:12.920" style="s2">the results are in.</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.820" end="00:44:19.120" style="s2">Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.320" end="00:44:22.020" style="s2">Milo has no blood relation to you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.120" end="00:44:24.420" style="s2">He&#39;s not your child.</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.020" end="00:44:24.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.520" end="00:44:28.820" style="s2">So she really did marry someone else.</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.720" end="00:44:30.120" style="s2">Then what am I even chasing?</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.820" end="00:44:32.420" style="s2">I&#39;ll leave the kids to you. I&#39;ll get</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.120" end="00:44:32.420" style="s2">going.</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.120" end="00:44:38.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good thing I had a backup plan, or Milo</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.220" end="00:44:38.220" style="s2">would have been taken, too.</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.020" end="00:44:43.220" style="s2">But he looked so disappointed. Is</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.820" end="00:44:44.520" style="s2">keeping them apart really what&#39;s best</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.220" end="00:44:46.220" style="s2">for the kids?</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.520" end="00:44:48.420" style="s2">No. What if Blair becomes their</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.220" end="00:44:50.620" style="s2">stepmother? I can&#39;t risk my kids.</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.420" end="00:44:52.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, did Daddy leave?</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.620" end="00:44:56.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You three, come here. Today was way too</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.420" end="00:44:58.821" style="s2">dangerous. No more sneaking out ever.</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.021" end="00:45:00.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So he really isn&#39;t Derek&#39;s child. Ella,</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.821" end="00:45:04.921" style="s2">you had another man&#39;s baby and you still</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.621" end="00:45:04.921" style="s2">expect Derek to marry you? Dream on.</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.121" end="00:45:12.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The kids have only been gone a day and I</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.521" end="00:45:15.821" style="s2">miss them like crazy. Bring Ella over</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.521" end="00:45:18.421" style="s2">too, then we won&#39;t have to be apart.</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.821" end="00:45:20.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s married and adopted a child.</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.421" end="00:45:22.221" style="s2">She won&#39;t come back with me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.621" end="00:45:23.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Another one?</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.221" end="00:45:25.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.621" end="00:45:27.821" style="s2">That kid doesn&#39;t have the moon mark and</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.321" end="00:45:29.521" style="s2">the blood test didn&#39;t match.</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.821" end="00:45:31.021" style="s2">I saw the marriage certificate and the</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.521" end="00:45:33.621" style="s2">adoption papers myself.</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.021" end="00:45:33.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me see.</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.721" end="00:45:39.121" style="s2">Think about it. How could an adopted kid</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.921" end="00:45:41.821" style="s2">happen to be the same age as your</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.121" end="00:45:43.521" style="s2">biological ones? And this man, his ears</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.821" end="00:45:45.921" style="s2">are all crooked. The photo&#39;s obviously</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.521" end="00:45:46.921" style="s2">photoshopped.</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.921" end="00:45:49.021" style="s2">You idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.921" end="00:45:52.321" style="s2">You&#39;re usually so sharp, but the second</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.021" end="00:45:53.321" style="s2">it comes to Ella, you lose your head.</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.321" end="00:45:56.821" style="s2">Dad, where are you going?</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.321" end="00:45:58.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To find my fourth grandchild.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.821" end="00:46:00.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finn, verify Ella&#39;s marriage</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.721" end="00:46:02.221" style="s2">registration and adoption papers</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.221" end="00:46:03.221" style="s2">directly.</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.221" end="00:46:05.821" style="s2">I want to see if her husband even</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.221" end="00:46:05.821" style="s2">exists.</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.751" end="00:46:10.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.121" end="00:46:11.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Derek comes over a few more times,</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.321" end="00:46:13.921" style="s2">Alex won&#39;t be able to stay hidden</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.621" end="00:46:13.921" style="s2">either.</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.021" end="00:46:18.221" style="s2">Babies, we&#39;re moving. Quick, pack your</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.021" end="00:46:20.221" style="s2">favorite toys.</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.221" end="00:46:23.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.221" end="00:46:23.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A mover&#39;s got here that fast?</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.721" end="00:46:34.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ella, I came to see the kids.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.921" end="00:46:36.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The place is a bit messy.</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.221" end="00:46:38.821" style="s2">Give me a sec to clean up.</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.921" end="00:46:41.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who cares if it&#39;s messy?</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.821" end="00:46:42.921" style="s2">I&#39;m not here for a health inspection.</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.121" end="00:46:44.121" style="s2">Let me see the kids.</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.921" end="00:46:46.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll bring the three of them over to</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.121" end="00:46:47.421" style="s2">keep you company in a bit, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.221" end="00:46:49.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three?</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.421" end="00:46:51.521" style="s2">What about Milo? You can&#39;t leave him</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.321" end="00:46:51.521" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.721" end="00:46:56.721" style="s2">Oh, my old back.</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.721" end="00:46:58.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, sorry. Take it easy.</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.721" end="00:46:59.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, it&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.323" end="00:47:01.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just seeing the kids makes it all</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.622" end="00:47:05.422" style="s2">better.</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.422" end="00:47:05.422" style="s2">My fourth little baby.</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.922" end="00:47:08.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Milo&#39;s adopted. Let me go get the</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.823" end="00:47:10.122" style="s2">papers.</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.622" end="00:47:12.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were carrying three and adopted</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.122" end="00:47:14.422" style="s2">another one? That&#39;s a lot for one mom.</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.622" end="00:47:16.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a husband. He helps me raise</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.422" end="00:47:16.723" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.223" end="00:47:21.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We checked. There&#39;s no adoption record</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.622" end="00:47:23.323" style="s2">and you&#39;re not married.</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.823" end="00:47:27.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We registered overseas.</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.323" end="00:47:27.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We asked about that too. Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.223" end="00:47:30.523" style="s2">Stop hiding it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.723" end="00:47:31.023" style="s2">Milo&#39;s your biological child too, isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.523" end="00:47:32.223" style="s2">he?</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.023" end="00:47:35.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.223" end="00:47:35.023" style="s2">He&#39;s mine too.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.797" end="00:47:40.922" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.122" end="00:47:43.523" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry I lied to you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.922" end="00:47:45.523" style="s2">But they&#39;re all my biological children.</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.523" end="00:47:47.023" style="s2">I just couldn&#39;t bear to give them up.</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.523" end="00:47:49.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You raised them all by yourself. You</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.023" end="00:47:50.622" style="s2">think I take them away? But four in</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.523" end="00:47:53.723" style="s2">total?</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.622" end="00:47:53.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh, yes, four.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.122" end="00:48:05.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See? It&#39;s right there. Derek, would it</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.622" end="00:48:05.723" style="s2">kill you to look closer?</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.023" end="00:48:10.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you not tell Derek yet?</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.422" end="00:48:13.122" style="s2">If he wants to take the kids,</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.622" end="00:48:14.823" style="s2">I definitely can&#39;t win.</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.122" end="00:48:16.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t say anything.</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.823" end="00:48:20.422" style="s2">But don&#39;t avoid me either. Let me spend</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.823" end="00:48:20.422" style="s2">time with the kids now and then, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.823" end="00:48:27.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I found out</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.122" end="00:48:29.823" style="s2">Ella is not married and the adoption</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.723" end="00:48:31.523" style="s2">papers are fake.</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.823" end="00:48:33.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By the time you finish investigating, my</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.523" end="00:48:35.523" style="s2">grandkids will be in college.</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.523" end="00:48:38.223" style="s2">Milo&#39;s mark is on the other shoulder and</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.523" end="00:48:39.422" style="s2">Ella admitted it. He&#39;s your child.</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.223" end="00:48:41.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She lied to me again.</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.422" end="00:48:43.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to find her.</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.422" end="00:48:45.422" style="s2">Going to accuse her again?</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.523" end="00:48:47.823" style="s2">All you talk about is the kids.</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.422" end="00:48:49.922" style="s2">You never care about her.</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.823" end="00:48:51.422" style="s2">Who she scared? You only want the kids.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.922" end="00:48:51.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to take responsibility for her,</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.422" end="00:48:53.323" style="s2">but</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.523" end="00:48:56.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then treat her right. Walking around</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.323" end="00:48:57.523" style="s2">with a permanent scowl, who can tell?</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.122" end="00:48:59.024" style="s2">If you want to get the kids back, win</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.523" end="00:49:02.324" style="s2">their mother over</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.024" end="00:49:02.324" style="s2">Make Ella my daughter-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.624" end="00:49:08.724" style="s2">Step one,</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.724" end="00:49:10.624" style="s2">take her to a candlelit dinner. Have a</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.724" end="00:49:14.024" style="s2">real date and don&#39;t bring up the kids</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.624" end="00:49:14.024" style="s2">the second you open your mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.324" end="00:49:19.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s Derek up to? Why is he suddenly</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.324" end="00:49:22.024" style="s2">asking me to dinner?</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.624" end="00:49:23.724" style="s2">Well, well, small world.</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.024" end="00:49:25.124" style="s2">A fancy place like this? You think you</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.724" end="00:49:26.524" style="s2">belong here?</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.124" end="00:49:27.724" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.524" end="00:49:29.024" style="s2">Last time you had those little brats</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.724" end="00:49:31.124" style="s2">mess with me and made Derek</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.024" end="00:49:33.324" style="s2">misunderstand me? I haven&#39;t settled the</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.124" end="00:49:36.324" style="s2">score with you yet.</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.324" end="00:49:37.924" style="s2">And you dare show up here to eat?</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.324" end="00:49:40.524" style="s2">Did you open this restaurant? I&#39;m here</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.924" end="00:49:42.924" style="s2">to eat. Is that any of your business?</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.524" end="00:49:46.324" style="s2">Get her out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.924" end="00:49:48.824" style="s2">But she&#39;s a customer. I&#39;m your VIP. This</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.324" end="00:49:49.924" style="s2"> is seducing my fiancé. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.824" end="00:49:52.724" style="s2">want to eat in the same restaurant as</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.924" end="00:49:54.824" style="s2">her. Miss, please leave on your own.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.724" end="00:49:56.424" style="s2">Don&#39;t make us call security.</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.824" end="00:49:58.824" style="s2">You believe everything she says? There&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.424" end="00:50:00.824" style="s2">someone waiting for me inside.</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.824" end="00:50:02.924" style="s2">What, hooked another man? Who are you</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.824" end="00:50:04.124" style="s2">planning to have kids for this time? Is</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.924" end="00:50:05.324" style="s2">there anything in that head of yours</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.124" end="00:50:07.724" style="s2">besides men?</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.324" end="00:50:11.024" style="s2">Get out of my way.</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.724" end="00:50:11.024" style="s2">What are you doing? Let go of me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.924" end="00:50:26.124" style="s2">Derek, what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.124" end="00:50:33.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this how you treat my guest?</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.924" end="00:50:34.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Ashton, I had no idea. Miss Wood</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.424" end="00:50:37.024" style="s2">said you&#39;re the one having dinner with</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.724" end="00:50:38.424" style="s2">Ella. Are you two actually together?</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.024" end="00:50:39.724" style="s2">Don&#39;t make things up. We&#39;re not like</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.424" end="00:50:40.724" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.724" end="00:50:42.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right.</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.724" end="00:50:43.824" style="s2">We&#39;re not together yet.</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.524" end="00:50:45.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew it.</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.824" end="00:50:48.424" style="s2">How could you possibly like a woman like</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.324" end="00:50:48.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the one pursuing her.</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.424" end="00:50:57.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.924" end="00:51:00.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I asked you to dinner tonight because I</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.124" end="00:51:00.224" style="s2">wanted to tell you how I feel.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.624" end="00:51:03.325" style="s2">As for you,</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.124" end="00:51:04.825" style="s2">if you can&#39;t treat every customer</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.325" end="00:51:06.525" style="s2">equally, you&#39;re done here.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.825" end="00:51:09.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. I really didn&#39;t know. Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.525" end="00:51:11.325" style="s2">Ashton, please give me another chance.</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.125" end="00:51:13.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Derek, you can&#39;t be with her. She&#39;s had</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.325" end="00:51:15.225" style="s2">another man&#39;s child. Our engagement was</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.425" end="00:51:16.825" style="s2">arranged by your mother. You&#39;re not even</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.225" end="00:51:19.025" style="s2">going to listen to her now?</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.825" end="00:51:20.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you ever slander Ella again.</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.025" end="00:51:21.425" style="s2">And as for the engagement my mom agreed</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.625" end="00:51:23.625" style="s2">to,</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.425" end="00:51:25.025" style="s2">go talk to her. I never agreed to marry</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.625" end="00:51:25.825" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.025" end="00:51:27.225" style="s2">Let&#39;s go sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.825" end="00:51:29.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Ashton, I don&#39;t want to eat anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.225" end="00:51:29.825" style="s2">I&#39;m going home.</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.625" end="00:51:38.825" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.725" end="00:51:41.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me drive you home.</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.825" end="00:51:41.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need. I&#39;ll get home myself.</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.025" end="00:51:47.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you hear what I said earlier?</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.525" end="00:51:50.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.625" end="00:51:50.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said I&#39;m pursuing you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.525" end="00:51:56.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t joke around. I have a husband.</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.725" end="00:51:57.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I don&#39;t know you&#39;ve been lying</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.825" end="00:51:59.125" style="s2">to me?</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.425" end="00:52:00.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what? What&#39;s it to you?</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.125" end="00:52:01.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we&#39;re together the kids won&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.425" end="00:52:02.625" style="s2">be separated from their mom and dad</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.725" end="00:52:05.825" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.625" end="00:52:05.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So it&#39;s still about the kids.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.925" end="00:52:08.525" style="s2">I don&#39;t agree.</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.025" end="00:52:14.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I say something wrong again?</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.625" end="00:52:14.725" style="s2">I&#39;m the one pursuing her.</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.025" end="00:52:21.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pursuing me?</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.425" end="00:52:23.325" style="s2">He just wants the kids back.</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.225" end="00:52:25.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, who made you upset?</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.325" end="00:52:27.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody. I&#39;m just tired.</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.025" end="00:52:29.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, I miss daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.225" end="00:52:29.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He really is good to the kids. If we</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.325" end="00:52:31.225" style="s2">were together</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.925" end="00:52:32.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our engagement was arranged by your</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.225" end="00:52:33.225" style="s2">mother.</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.225" end="00:52:34.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.225" end="00:52:36.625" style="s2">His mom still thinks of Blair as her</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.725" end="00:52:38.525" style="s2">daughter-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.625" end="00:52:41.025" style="s2">What am I even thinking?</p>
<p begin="00:52:38.525" end="00:52:42.525" style="s2">All right, babies. Time for bed.</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.025" end="00:52:45.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good night, mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.525" end="00:52:45.325" style="s2">Good night.</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.525" end="00:52:54.225" style="s2">Mommy won&#39;t find out we came to see</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.025" end="00:52:58.025" style="s2">daddy, right? If she knew how much we</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.225" end="00:52:58.025" style="s2">miss daddy, she&#39;d be sad.</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.725" end="00:53:04.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you two doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.925" end="00:53:06.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We missed you.</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.827" end="00:53:08.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t tell mommy she&#39;ll get jealous.</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.927" end="00:53:10.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, are you really going to marry</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.327" end="00:53:11.527" style="s2">that awful woman? Mommy&#39;s a million</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.327" end="00:53:12.727" style="s2">times better than her.</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.527" end="00:53:14.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.727" end="00:53:15.227" style="s2">Next week I&#39;m announcing the engagement</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.127" end="00:53:16.427" style="s2">is off.</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.227" end="00:53:18.727" style="s2">The only one I want to marry is your</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.427" end="00:53:18.727" style="s2">mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.027" end="00:53:21.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy said he&#39;s not marrying the bad</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.727" end="00:53:23.227" style="s2">woman.</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.727" end="00:53:26.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s great.</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.227" end="00:53:28.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy&#39;s house has so much good food and</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.027" end="00:53:31.127" style="s2">so many fun things. I want you guys to</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.427" end="00:53:31.127" style="s2">come too.</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.927" end="00:53:38.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if we all leave? What about mommy?</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.927" end="00:53:42.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s help daddy win mommy back so</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.927" end="00:53:42.327" style="s2">we can all live together.</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.527" end="00:53:46.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t follow me up. I&#39;ll just bring the</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.227" end="00:53:47.327" style="s2">kids down.</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.227" end="00:53:49.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m afraid you&#39;ll get the wrong door</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.327" end="00:53:49.527" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.527" end="00:53:58.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay for a week. Mommy will pick you up</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.827" end="00:53:58.727" style="s2">next week. Be good and listen to daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.627" end="00:54:06.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you thought about what I asked last</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.927" end="00:54:07.427" style="s2">time?</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.127" end="00:54:09.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.427" end="00:54:09.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marry me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.827" end="00:54:18.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s even using a proposal just to get</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.427" end="00:54:19.427" style="s2">the kids back.</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.827" end="00:54:21.827" style="s2">I don&#39;t want a marriage [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.427" end="00:54:21.827" style="s2">like that.</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.247" end="00:54:26.227" style="s2">[snorts] Not considering it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.627" end="00:54:40.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ella, don&#39;t believe him. He just wants</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.927" end="00:54:42.227" style="s2">the kids.</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.427" end="00:54:45.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why is my heart racing? I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.227" end="00:54:45.527" style="s2">actually No way.</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.627" end="00:54:49.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, are you sick? Why&#39;s your face so</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.227" end="00:54:52.327" style="s2">red?</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.027" end="00:54:52.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s It&#39;s too hot in here.</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.723" end="00:54:54.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.727" end="00:54:59.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, do you really want to marry</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.327" end="00:54:59.627" style="s2">mommy?</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.327" end="00:55:03.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.727" end="00:55:06.927" style="s2">Once your mommy and I get married we</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.927" end="00:55:06.927" style="s2">won&#39;t have to be a part anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.027" end="00:55:11.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THEN WE&#39;LL HELP WIN MOMMY OVER.</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.828" end="00:55:20.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DADDY, CAN WE start now?</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.428" end="00:55:22.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s start.</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.428" end="00:55:26.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First, you got to know what mommy likes.</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.728" end="00:55:26.628" style="s2">Her favorite food is bananas.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.128" end="00:55:34.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who sent all these bananas? You trying</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.728" end="00:55:36.828" style="s2">to raise me like a monkey?</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.428" end="00:55:39.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy likes red. She doesn&#39;t like BLACK</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.828" end="00:55:39.628" style="s2">OR GRAY.</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.128" end="00:55:47.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IS SOME VIP coming today?</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.228" end="00:55:48.628" style="s2">No idea. The president specifically</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.228" end="00:55:50.628" style="s2">ordered it, said to lay it all the way</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.628" end="00:55:53.628" style="s2">to your desk.</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.628" end="00:55:55.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy loves sleeping in. Every morning</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.628" end="00:55:59.128" style="s2">when the alarm goes off, she wants to</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.628" end="00:55:59.128" style="s2">throw it across the room.</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.128" end="00:56:04.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ella, your morning meeting is canceled.</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.128" end="00:56:05.928" style="s2">From now on, report at 11:00. The</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.628" end="00:56:08.428" style="s2">president approved it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.928" end="00:56:08.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just me?</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.828" end="00:56:19.828" style="s2">Mr. Ashton, why are you targeting me? Do</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.128" end="00:56:22.328" style="s2">you have a problem with me?</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.828" end="00:56:22.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A problem?</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.828" end="00:56:27.328" style="s2">What am I targeting you about?</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.628" end="00:56:29.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s with all these bananas?</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.328" end="00:56:30.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you love bananas?</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.628" end="00:56:33.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why did you cancel my morning</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.928" end="00:56:34.928" style="s2">meeting and make me come in at 11:00?</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.128" end="00:56:36.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you hate waking up early? I wanted</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.928" end="00:56:37.328" style="s2">you to sleep in a bit.</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.428" end="00:56:39.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.328" end="00:56:40.928" style="s2">This is just ridiculous.</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.428" end="00:56:42.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you&#39;d like it. And the red</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.928" end="00:56:43.828" style="s2">carpet, did you see it?</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.428" end="00:56:45.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.828" end="00:56:47.928" style="s2">It goes all the way to my desk.</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.728" end="00:56:49.128" style="s2">Now the whole company is staring at me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.928" end="00:56:50.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t like it?</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.128" end="00:56:52.728" style="s2">I&#39;ll have them take it down. Kids, are</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.728" end="00:56:54.928" style="s2">you actually helping me or sabotaging</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.728" end="00:56:54.928" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.628" end="00:57:00.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really are willing to go to all this</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.728" end="00:57:00.028" style="s2">trouble just to get the kids back.</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.328" end="00:57:04.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not just about the kids.</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.628" end="00:57:07.828" style="s2">It&#39;s for you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.828" end="00:57:11.328" style="s2">Ella,</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.828" end="00:57:11.328" style="s2">I like you. I want to marry</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.929" end="00:57:15.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I don&#39;t believe a word you say.</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.129" end="00:57:21.929" style="s2">Is he serious? Or is he just messing</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.229" end="00:57:21.929" style="s2">with me again?</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.329" end="00:57:26.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Calm down, Ella. His engagement isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.529" end="00:57:28.929" style="s2">even canceled yet, and his mom still</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.229" end="00:57:28.929" style="s2">sides with Blair.</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.819" end="00:57:37.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.404" end="00:57:42.329" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.929" end="00:57:43.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you keep staring at her like that,</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.329" end="00:57:44.729" style="s2">she&#39;s going to take the stairs next</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.329" end="00:57:46.029" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.729" end="00:57:47.729" style="s2">Got a better idea?</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.029" end="00:57:49.329" style="s2">Tonight&#39;s outfit isn&#39;t decided yet. Have</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.729" end="00:57:51.729" style="s2">Miss Jones help you pick. She&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.329" end="00:57:51.729" style="s2">designer.</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.729" end="00:57:56.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you need me for?</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.529" end="00:58:00.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was hoping you could help me pick an</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.629" end="00:58:00.129" style="s2">outfit. Is now a good time?</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.929" end="00:58:05.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This one. Change the tie. It&#39;s too dull.</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.129" end="00:58:08.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So my usual style is boring?</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.029" end="00:58:08.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally, some self-awareness.</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.729" end="00:58:14.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then today, I&#39;ll do whatever you say.</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.810" end="00:58:17.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.129" end="00:58:17.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold still. Let me see.</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.029" end="00:58:25.729" style="s2">Look at the tie. Why are you looking at</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.329" end="00:58:28.229" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.729" end="00:58:28.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch out.</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.529" end="00:58:42.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you guys doing?</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.729" end="00:58:42.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We didn&#39;t see you two kissing.</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.129" end="00:58:52.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saw wrong. We weren&#39;t kissing.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.729" end="00:58:54.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you can keep going. We&#39;ll leave</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.329" end="00:58:54.729" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.129" end="00:58:59.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The outfit&#39;s picked. I&#39;m going back to</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.729" end="00:59:00.929" style="s2">work.</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.329" end="00:59:02.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about the tie? You didn&#39;t finish</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.929" end="00:59:05.329" style="s2">picking.</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.529" end="00:59:05.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pick it yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.729" end="00:59:18.131" style="s2">I I for 1 minute and you two are already</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.331" end="00:59:20.731" style="s2">flirting? Derek, if Ella can give you</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.131" end="00:59:23.531" style="s2">children, so can I. After today, you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.731" end="00:59:23.531" style="s2">have to marry me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.531" end="00:59:37.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is that awful woman back? Daddy&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.531" end="00:59:39.131" style="s2">not even marrying her anymore. What does</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.331" end="00:59:40.931" style="s2">she want now?</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.131" end="00:59:43.931" style="s2">Is she trying to bully mommy again?</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.931" end="00:59:43.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, let&#39;s follow her.</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.631" end="00:59:59.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Derek, I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.131" end="01:00:09.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blair, what did you give me?</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.831" end="01:00:10.831" style="s2">My heat came early.</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.031" end="01:00:12.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re [snorts] so into Ella. What was I</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.831" end="01:00:15.831" style="s2">supposed to do?</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.831" end="01:00:18.631" style="s2">After today, you&#39;ll have to marry me.</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.831" end="01:00:18.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me.</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.031" end="01:00:25.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop struggling, Derek.</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.131" end="01:00:27.731" style="s2">How am I any less than her?</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.931" end="01:00:29.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong with daddy?</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.731" end="01:00:32.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something&#39;s not right. Quick, go get</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.631" end="01:00:32.031" style="s2">mommy.</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.931" end="01:00:40.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you two doing out here again?</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.431" end="01:00:41.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, that awful woman is in daddy&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.131" end="01:00:43.131" style="s2">office.</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.431" end="01:00:45.831" style="s2">Daddy&#39;s not feeling well, and she won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.131" end="01:00:45.831" style="s2">let go of him.</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.131" end="01:00:51.931" style="s2">Mommy, come quick.</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.731" end="01:01:00.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.731" end="01:01:08.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Derek, I really do like you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.131" end="01:01:08.631" style="s2">Why won&#39;t you just look at me?</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.432" end="01:01:34.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.632" end="01:01:36.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My heat came early. I might</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.732" end="01:01:39.932" style="s2">not be okay.</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.132" end="01:01:39.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not okay? Then I&#39;ll go get a doctor.</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.932" end="01:01:45.532" style="s2">You&#39;re not yourself right now. You need</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.032" end="01:01:45.532" style="s2">a doctor.</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.997" end="01:01:50.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.732" end="01:01:52.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Step one of daddy&#39;s plan to win mommy</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.432" end="01:01:55.232" style="s2">back, complete.</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.732" end="01:01:57.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you&#39;re a werewolf?</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.232" end="01:01:59.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The kids can turn into wolves.</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.232" end="01:02:00.732" style="s2">I thought you already knew who I was.</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.832" end="01:02:02.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How was I supposed to know they were</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.732" end="01:02:03.532" style="s2">wolves?</p>
<p begin="01:02:02.432" end="01:02:07.332" style="s2">I always thought it was my genetic</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.532" end="01:02:07.332" style="s2">defect that made them turn into dogs.</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.532" end="01:02:11.632" style="s2">So it was your fault all along.</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.032" end="01:02:21.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still haven&#39;t answered that question</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.132" end="01:02:21.632" style="s2">from last time.</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.432" end="01:02:24.932" style="s2">Will you marry me?</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.632" end="01:02:30.932" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to be afraid. I&#39;ll take</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.732" end="01:02:33.532" style="s2">the kids from you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.932" end="01:02:36.032" style="s2">Kids are yours. My fortune is yours, and</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.532" end="01:02:36.032" style="s2">I&#39;m yours too.</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.932" end="01:02:39.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you&#39;re still engaged.</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.132" end="01:02:40.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mom arranged that.</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.332" end="01:02:41.932" style="s2">I never agreed to it.</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.932" end="01:02:44.232" style="s2">I&#39;ll cancel it and give you a proper</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.932" end="01:02:44.232" style="s2">answer.</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.132" end="01:02:50.132" style="s2">You&#39;re the only one I want to marry.</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.632" end="01:02:53.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no. Derek still doesn&#39;t know about</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.532" end="01:02:56.732" style="s2">Alex.</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.632" end="01:02:56.732" style="s2">I need to find a chance to tell him.</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.332" end="01:03:03.732" style="s2">Blair, why did you suddenly fly out to</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.632" end="01:03:06.432" style="s2">see me?</p>
<p begin="01:03:03.732" end="01:03:08.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been gone so long. I missed you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.432" end="01:03:09.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re always so thoughtful.</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.132" end="01:03:10.932" style="s2">You are every bit the wife I chose for</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.732" end="01:03:13.832" style="s2">Derek.</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.932" end="01:03:13.832" style="s2">I was not wrong about you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.932" end="01:03:16.232" style="s2">But I&#39;m afraid I can&#39;t be your</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.732" end="01:03:17.733" style="s2">daughter-in-law anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.232" end="01:03:19.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What What Derek say this</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.733" end="01:03:21.733" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.033" end="01:03:23.833" style="s2">Some woman latched onto him.</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.733" end="01:03:26.233" style="s2">She seduced him a few years ago and had</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.833" end="01:03:27.833" style="s2">three of his kids.</p>
<p begin="01:03:26.233" end="01:03:30.233" style="s2">Now she wants to marry in using the</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.833" end="01:03:32.933" style="s2">kids. He even said he&#39;s going to break</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.233" end="01:03:36.233" style="s2">off the engagement for her.</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.933" end="01:03:36.233" style="s2">She gave Derek three children.</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.333" end="01:03:40.733" style="s2">But she had another man&#39;s child, too.</p>
<p begin="01:03:39.333" end="01:03:43.133" style="s2">She got pregnant out of wedlock back in</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.733" end="01:03:43.133" style="s2">school.</p>
<p begin="01:03:45.433" end="01:03:48.733" style="s2">Is a wife that messy?</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.233" end="01:03:51.133" style="s2">How could she ever set foot in the Aston</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.733" end="01:03:51.133" style="s2">family?</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.633" end="01:03:54.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A woman like that,</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.033" end="01:03:56.433" style="s2">no matter how many grandchildren she</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.233" end="01:03:59.733" style="s2">gives me, I&#39;ll never accept her.</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.433" end="01:04:00.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Susan, you have to stand up for me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.733" end="01:04:03.033" style="s2">Pack your things.</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.933" end="01:04:05.033" style="s2">You&#39;re coming back with me.</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.033" end="01:04:08.633" style="s2">I want to see what gives her the right</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.033" end="01:04:08.633" style="s2">to make Derek break off his engagement.</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.933" end="01:04:17.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GRANDPA, WATCH OUT.</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.333" end="01:04:28.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HONEY,</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.433" end="01:04:28.233" style="s2">why are you back early?</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.633" end="01:04:36.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I hadn&#39;t come back, this house would</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.133" end="01:04:39.833" style="s2">have been turned upside down. What&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.833" end="01:04:43.033" style="s2">going on with these children?</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.833" end="01:04:45.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have grandkids. Noah, Theo, Nina, say</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.033" end="01:04:47.533" style="s2">hi TO GRANDMA.</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.533" end="01:04:49.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HI GRANDMA.</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.533" end="01:04:51.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t accept this.</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.233" end="01:04:53.433" style="s2">The Wolf King&#39;s children, not just any</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.433" end="01:04:55.733" style="s2">woman deserves to bear them. Send them</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.433" end="01:04:59.533" style="s2">away. They&#39;re giving me a headache.</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.733" end="01:04:59.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, are we being too loud?</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.333" end="01:05:04.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll be quiet. Please don&#39;t be mad.</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.233" end="01:05:07.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You must be tired from the flight. Want</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.933" end="01:05:07.933" style="s2">me to rub your back?</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.633" end="01:05:14.633" style="s2">Grandpa, does grandma not like us?</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.933" end="01:05:16.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not. You&#39;re such good kids.</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.633" end="01:05:17.600" style="s2">She just doesn&#39;t know you yet. Give her</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.533" end="01:05:19.633" style="s2">some time.</p>
<p begin="01:05:17.600" end="01:05:21.935" style="s2">[snorts] Before Susan left, she was</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.633" end="01:05:23.335" style="s2">dying to hold a grandchild.</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.935" end="01:05:25.735" style="s2">Why&#39;s she so different now that she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.335" end="01:05:25.735" style="s2">back?</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.035" end="01:05:37.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, does my dress look pretty?</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.735" end="01:05:39.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Beautiful. Our Nina looks pretty in</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.835" end="01:05:40.635" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.135" end="01:05:43.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, I&#39;ll take you to see the</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.635" end="01:05:44.835" style="s2">airplane. Grandma, come catch me. If you</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.135" end="01:05:48.385" style="s2">catch me, I&#39;ll give you a kiss.</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.835" end="01:05:50.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, okay, slow down. Don&#39;t fall.</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.385" end="01:05:50.405" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:05:52.335" end="01:05:55.335" style="s2">So it was a dream.</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.935" end="01:05:59.135" style="s2">Kids really are lovable.</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.735" end="01:06:01.435" style="s2">Too bad they&#39;re stuck with a mother like</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.135" end="01:06:01.435" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.935" end="01:06:06.070" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.035" end="01:06:08.090" style="s2">I can&#39;t let Derek marry her.</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.070" end="01:06:08.090" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.835" end="01:06:17.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex, why are you upset?</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.835" end="01:06:19.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You guys all get to CALL HIM DADDY, BUT</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.635" end="01:06:20.635" style="s2">I have to hide.</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.035" end="01:06:23.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy said she&#39;ll tell him and grandpa</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.635" end="01:06:25.635" style="s2">soon. Just wait a little longer.</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.835" end="01:06:27.635" style="s2">Big bro, how about we sneak a peek at</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.635" end="01:06:30.435" style="s2">daddy at the office tomorrow? Just don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.635" end="01:06:30.435" style="s2">let him see us.</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.335" end="01:06:41.835" style="s2">If I keep going, I should reach daddy&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.435" end="01:06:41.835" style="s2">office.</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.735" end="01:06:45.935" style="s2">Grandma, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.235" end="01:06:47.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I twisted my ankle.</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.935" end="01:06:50.835" style="s2">My phone fell in there. Sweetie, can you</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.935" end="01:06:50.835" style="s2">get someone for me?</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.135" end="01:06:59.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t move. Let me rub it for you.</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.235" end="01:07:00.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That actually feels better. What&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.835" end="01:07:03.335" style="s2">name?</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.735" end="01:07:03.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex.</p>
<p begin="01:07:03.935" end="01:07:07.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re so young. How do you know how to</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.835" end="01:07:09.735" style="s2">take care of people?</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.935" end="01:07:12.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy works really hard, so I rub her</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.735" end="01:07:14.835" style="s2">shoulders a lot. I&#39;m the oldest, so of</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.035" end="01:07:16.835" style="s2">course I got to help her.</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.835" end="01:07:20.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mommy is so lucky.</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.835" end="01:07:20.535" style="s2">I wish I had a grandson like you.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.235" end="01:07:26.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, I got to go home.</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.736" end="01:07:26.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t wander off. Call your family to</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.136" end="01:07:30.336" style="s2">come get you.</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.836" end="01:07:30.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good boy. Hurry home now.</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.136" end="01:07:39.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want to try it on?</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.836" end="01:07:56.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ella, you&#39;re beautiful.</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.636" end="01:07:57.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did I never notice you&#39;re such a</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.036" end="01:07:59.936" style="s2">smooth talker?</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.036" end="01:07:59.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just telling you the truth.</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.036" end="01:08:04.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So should I wear this to your mom&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.136" end="01:08:05.636" style="s2">welcome dinner?</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.336" end="01:08:07.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:08:05.636" end="01:08:08.736" style="s2">That night I&#39;ll announce the engagement</p>
<p begin="01:08:07.036" end="01:08:10.636" style="s2">is off</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.736" end="01:08:12.636" style="s2">and I&#39;ll tell everyone the one I want to</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.636" end="01:08:15.636" style="s2">marry is you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.636" end="01:08:17.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t said yes yet.</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.636" end="01:08:19.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll keep pursuing you until you</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.336" end="01:08:19.636" style="s2">do.</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.736" end="01:08:27.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t keep hiding it from him anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.236" end="01:08:29.836" style="s2">At the welcome dinner I&#39;ll tell them</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.036" end="01:08:29.836" style="s2">about Alex.</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.636" end="01:08:36.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Susan, Ella is coming tonight too.</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.236" end="01:08:37.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have to stand up for me.</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.736" end="01:08:39.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="01:08:37.936" end="01:08:42.236" style="s2">I&#39;ll announce in front of everyone that</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.336" end="01:08:42.236" style="s2">you&#39;re my daughter-in-law.</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.336" end="01:08:53.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five kids, all hers?</p>
<p begin="01:08:52.236" end="01:08:55.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Susan, that&#39;s her. See, she&#39;s got</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.936" end="01:08:57.236" style="s2">another kid now. She really thinks she</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.936" end="01:09:00.436" style="s2">can bring another man&#39;s children into</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.236" end="01:09:02.036" style="s2">the Austin family? Mrs. Austin, hello.</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.436" end="01:09:03.836" style="s2">I&#39;m Ella.</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.036" end="01:09:06.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t think you&#39;d actually have the</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.836" end="01:09:06.536" style="s2">nerve to show up.</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.036" end="01:09:10.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is our first time meeting. Is there</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.836" end="01:09:11.436" style="s2">some misunderstanding?</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.236" end="01:09:13.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think having kids means you can</p>
<p begin="01:09:11.436" end="01:09:16.436" style="s2">force Derek to marry you? The Austin</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.436" end="01:09:18.536" style="s2">family doesn&#39;t just let anyone in.</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.436" end="01:09:20.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Derek invited me and I&#39;ve never used my</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.536" end="01:09:23.936" style="s2">children to force them into anything.</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.836" end="01:09:23.936" style="s2">You can&#39;t say that about me.</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.436" end="01:09:29.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, is your foot better?</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.237" end="01:09:32.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex?</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.438" end="01:09:32.338" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:09:34.538" end="01:09:37.737" style="s2">You You&#39;re her son?</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.538" end="01:09:45.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, she&#39;s my mommy.</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.438" end="01:09:47.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, why were you yelling at her?</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.538" end="01:09:48.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You heard her? Aunt Susan doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.137" end="01:09:50.737" style="s2">welcome you. You still think you can</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.938" end="01:09:52.137" style="s2">marry into the Aston family?</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.737" end="01:09:55.438" style="s2">Get out of here with these little brats.</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.137" end="01:09:55.438" style="s2">Don&#39;t embarrass yourself here.</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.338" end="01:09:59.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You dare hit me?</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.738" end="01:10:00.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I warned you. Stop calling my children</p>
<p begin="01:09:59.838" end="01:10:02.738" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.637" end="01:10:05.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Susan, you saw that, right?</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.738" end="01:10:07.338" style="s2">She hit me right in front of you.</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.338" end="01:10:09.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you think this place is?</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.338" end="01:10:10.438" style="s2">Hitting someone in public?</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.038" end="01:10:12.038" style="s2">Is this the example you set for your</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.438" end="01:10:14.338" style="s2">children?</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.038" end="01:10:15.838" style="s2">I absolutely will not allow you to join</p>
<p begin="01:10:14.338" end="01:10:17.038" style="s2">our family and become the Wolf King&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.838" end="01:10:18.038" style="s2">Luna.</p>
<p begin="01:10:17.038" end="01:10:19.938" style="s2">Then you heard what she called my</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.038" end="01:10:21.438" style="s2">children.</p>
<p begin="01:10:19.938" end="01:10:23.838" style="s2">You can dislike me,</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.438" end="01:10:26.137" style="s2">but you can&#39;t just let her insult them.</p>
<p begin="01:10:23.838" end="01:10:27.238" style="s2">You dare talk back to me? Get out.</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.137" end="01:10:29.038" style="s2">You&#39;re not welcome here tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.238" end="01:10:31.338" style="s2">Security, get her and these kids out of</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.038" end="01:10:31.338" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.238" end="01:10:35.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d like to see who dares.</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.238" end="01:10:42.838" style="s2">Ella is my guest.</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.838" end="01:10:45.538" style="s2">Anyone who touches her or the kids</p>
<p begin="01:10:42.838" end="01:10:45.538" style="s2">answers to me.</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.938" end="01:10:52.637" style="s2">Wait. Ella, how come there&#39;s another</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.338" end="01:10:52.637" style="s2">one?</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.137" end="01:10:58.538" style="s2">Ella, what&#39;s going on here?</p>
<p begin="01:10:55.637" end="01:10:59.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His name is Alex. He&#39;s the oldest.</p>
<p begin="01:10:58.538" end="01:11:00.938" style="s2">I never found the right time to tell</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.838" end="01:11:03.938" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:11:00.938" end="01:11:03.938" style="s2">I had quintuplets.</p>
<p begin="01:11:04.238" end="01:11:09.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five? Ella, you&#39;re a blessing to our</p>
<p begin="01:11:06.838" end="01:11:09.338" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.838" end="01:11:13.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Susan, don&#39;t believe her. That</p>
<p begin="01:11:11.438" end="01:11:15.538" style="s2">extra kid must be another man&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.538" end="01:11:18.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What blessing? You believe everything</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.538" end="01:11:18.338" style="s2">she says?</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.038" end="01:11:22.538" style="s2">You still want to marry a woman like</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.538" end="01:11:25.637" style="s2">this? Haven&#39;t we embarrassed the</p>
<p begin="01:11:22.538" end="01:11:25.637" style="s2">werewolf pack enough?</p>
<p begin="01:11:25.738" end="01:11:29.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:11:26.738" end="01:11:32.939" style="s2">I know exactly what kind of person Ella</p>
<p begin="01:11:29.539" end="01:11:32.939" style="s2">You can&#39;t just go by Blair&#39;s word.</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.439" end="01:11:37.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can do a blood test. These kids</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.339" end="01:11:38.539" style="s2">aren&#39;t even yours. Are you really going</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.139" end="01:11:40.739" style="s2">to lie to your own mother just to marry</p>
<p begin="01:11:38.539" end="01:11:40.739" style="s2">her?</p>
<p begin="01:11:42.039" end="01:11:46.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not senile yet. She had your</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.439" end="01:11:48.139" style="s2">children and another man&#39;s, too. If</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.539" end="01:11:49.939" style="s2">that&#39;s not trying to marry in using the</p>
<p begin="01:11:48.139" end="01:11:52.039" style="s2">kids, what is it?</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.939" end="01:11:55.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve never had another man&#39;s child. All</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.039" end="01:11:55.339" style="s2">five of them are Derek&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.539" end="01:12:00.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can fool them, but not me. I watched</p>
<p begin="01:11:59.139" end="01:12:03.439" style="s2">Blair grow up. Would she lie about</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.639" end="01:12:03.439" style="s2">something like this?</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.339" end="01:12:09.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, let us prove it to her.</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.439" end="01:12:26.339" style="s2">This pressure,</p>
<p begin="01:12:22.739" end="01:12:26.339" style="s2">it really is our bloodline.</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.539" end="01:12:40.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The children are ours.</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.039" end="01:12:42.339" style="s2">I accept that.</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.539" end="01:12:43.939" style="s2">But that doesn&#39;t mean I agree to you</p>
<p begin="01:12:42.339" end="01:12:45.739" style="s2">marrying Derek.</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.939" end="01:12:48.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The kids already proved it.</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.739" end="01:12:50.039" style="s2">You still won&#39;t believe Ella?</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.039" end="01:12:51.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what about Blair? I watched her grow</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.039" end="01:12:52.739" style="s2">up. Are you saying everything she told</p>
<p begin="01:12:51.439" end="01:12:54.339" style="s2">me was a lie?</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.739" end="01:12:55.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Susan,</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.339" end="01:12:57.839" style="s2">I did it all for Derek&#39;s own good.</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.839" end="01:13:00.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In that case, Mom, let me show you what</p>
<p begin="01:12:57.839" end="01:13:00.739" style="s2">Blair&#39;s really done.</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.345" end="01:13:03.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.339" end="01:13:18.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Turn it off. Those are all fake.</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.410" end="01:13:20.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.239" end="01:13:21.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bullying children, drugging someone</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.039" end="01:13:22.939" style="s2">illegally,</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.139" end="01:13:24.339" style="s2">the office cameras caught all of it.</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.939" end="01:13:26.939" style="s2">Blair, what do you have to say for</p>
<p begin="01:13:24.339" end="01:13:26.939" style="s2">yourself now?</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.939" end="01:13:30.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blair,</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.339" end="01:13:33.840" style="s2">you did all of this?</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.740" end="01:13:36.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Susan,</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.840" end="01:13:38.040" style="s2">Ella forced me into it.</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.140" end="01:13:39.340" style="s2">If she hadn&#39;t come after Derek,</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.040" end="01:13:40.540" style="s2">why would I</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.340" end="01:13:44.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.540" end="01:13:44.240" style="s2">You&#39;ve been lying to me this whole time.</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.240" end="01:13:55.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t let you slander Ella anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.840" end="01:13:59.640" style="s2">I ask everyone here to witness my</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.340" end="01:14:01.840" style="s2">engagement to Blair is officially</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.640" end="01:14:05.040" style="s2">canceled.</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.840" end="01:14:05.040" style="s2">The only one I want to marry is Ella.</p>
<p begin="01:14:10.640" end="01:14:14.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blair, you&#39;re suspected of inciting</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.840" end="01:14:14.940" style="s2">assault. Please come with us.</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.340" end="01:14:18.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Derek,</p>
<p begin="01:14:16.240" end="01:14:20.340" style="s2">I&#39;m your fiance.</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.740" end="01:14:23.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I gave you chances and you kept hurting</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.340" end="01:14:23.140" style="s2">her and the children.</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.461" end="01:14:31.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.740" end="01:14:34.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. I believed her and wronged</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.340" end="01:14:34.240" style="s2">you and the children.</p>
<p begin="01:14:34.540" end="01:14:40.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, do you still hate us?</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.140" end="01:14:44.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not. Grandma was foolish.</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.940" end="01:14:44.240" style="s2">Don&#39;t be mad at me, okay?</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.840" end="01:14:48.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you&#39;ll play with us from now on.</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.316" end="01:14:57.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.940" end="01:15:00.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So does this mean we won&#39;t have to be</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.540" end="01:15:00.540" style="s2">apart anymore?</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.640" end="01:15:04.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.521" end="01:15:06.640" style="s2">[snorts] From now on, we&#39;ll all be</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.140" end="01:15:06.640" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="01:15:11.692" end="01:15:13.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.040" end="01:15:16.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be scared. I&#39;ll be right outside</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.540" end="01:15:16.140" style="s2">waiting for you.</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.140" end="01:15:30.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations. It&#39;s a girl.</p>
<p begin="01:15:26.240" end="01:15:30.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YES, WE HAVE A LITTLE SISTER.</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.740" end="01:15:33.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HOW&#39;S ELLA?</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.040" end="01:15:34.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHE&#39;S DOING GREAT.</p>
<p begin="01:15:33.542" end="01:15:37.542" style="s2">WAIT.</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.642" end="01:15:37.542" style="s2">There&#39;s another one.</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.892" end="01:15:39.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [crying]</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.742" end="01:15:43.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What, there&#39;s another one?</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
